<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ghamatendo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ghamatendo ghe Iwatumighwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ghamatendo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ghama</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ghamatendo ghe Iwatumighwa</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu che Ghamatendo ghe Iwatumighwa chosimulila mbuli tse iwanu iwamtoghole Kiristu pfawanzile na pfawenele kulawa Yelusalemu mbaka Yudea, Samariya na tsiisi tsingi, ka apfila Yesu pfawalongele iwanang'ina wake (1:8). Chitabu chino chandikighwa na Luka na yeye iyo iyandike Imbuli Inoghile ya Luka. Yeye tsakakala bwana mghanga na yang'ali yakwandika pfinoghile ghendo pfinu ka pfapfilawile. Pfitabu pfake pfose pfili tsakamwandikila imunu yumwe Mgiriki iyakemighwe Teofili, lekeni pfipfila tsakawandikila Wakiristu Wagiriki na Wayahudi (1:1)</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Ghamatendo ghe Iwatumighwa chakoneka chandikighwa mne miyaka ya sitini mbaka sitini na mine kulawa Yesu hakalile muisi, kwaapfila chitabu chomalitsila Pauli ng'ana yalekelelighwe bae kulawa mwigheletsa. Pfipfila Luka tsakanga na Mtumighwa Pauli, na kandika chitabu chino hayang'ali ako Antiyokiya. Chitabu chino choghendeletsa aghala ighali mne chitabu chake cha Imbuli Inoghile yandikighwe na Luka, na chakwandusa kwa kutulongela Yesu pfayokile kulanga. Ighali mne chitabu chino gheghala na aghala ighali mne chitabu chake cha Imbuli Inoghile. Tsakambama Teofili na iwakiristu iwakongetseka waghakinde aghala ghayawalangulitse. Apfo Luka kandika chila chinu chatendile Yesu na ukwenela kwa Wakiristu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Ghamatendo ghe Iwatumighwa chotulongela tuwe ka Wakiristu wamwanduso pfawawile na pfawakalile kwa kumtoghola Kiristu. Pfipfila watumighwa wotulongela tumlombe Muhe mwenzeluka hatukwenetsa Imbuli Inoghile kwa iwanu wengi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-8-1, Muhe mwenzeluka kowatsila iwanang'ina, na Wakiristu wakongetseka.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 8:2-1223, Wakiristu wodununzika na wakwandusa kwenela mbaka kunze kwa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 12:24-1428, Pauli na Balinaba wakuka ghumwanza ghwawo ghwa mwanduso ghwa kupeta Imbuli Inoghile.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 15:1-35, Libalatsa lyetingana ako Yelusalemu kulamula choni chitendeke kwa Wakiristu wa sambi.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 15:36-1822, Pauli kakuka ghumwanza ghwake ghwa keli.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 18:23-2038, Pauli kakuka ghumwanza ghwake ghwa kadatu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 15:1-35, Pauli koghoghighwa ako Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 27-28, Pauli koghalighwa Roma.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Kuna imkulu Teofili,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Mne ichitabu changu chanongole ukwandika, tsanyandika ipfinu pfose Yesu pfatendile na pfayalangulitse, kulawa handuse isang'ano yake <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbaka litsuwa lila hayasolighwe kughenda kulanga. Ichipindi ng'ana yasolighwe, tsakaweng'a malaghitso kwa uwetso wa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka iwatumighwa wala iyawasaghule. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Matsuwa alubaini kulawa hafile, Yesu kawalawila mala nyingi na kwilangusa ghendo ka tsakakala mghima. Wamwona, naye kalonga nawo mbuli tse Undewa we Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Na litsuwa limwe, hayang'ali yakuja nawo kawalaghitsa pfino, “Mleke kulawa Yerusalemu, ila mwemwe mbete achila chayalongile Aba, iyo Ghumuhe yamnihulike nomlonga. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohane tsakabatitsa kwa ghamatsi, lekeni matsuwa chidogho ighakutsa, mtsobatitsighwa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosolighwa kulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Malk 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Iwatumighwa hawetingane na Yesu, wamghutsa, “Imtwatsa, pfii matsuwa ghano kutsowoyitsila Waisiraeli Undewa?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu kawalongela, “Matsuwa na msimu pfamne uwetso wa Aba wangu, mwemwe ng'ambamighwa bae kumanya itsakuwa tsuwachi. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Lekeni Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka hatsowahulumkila, mtsobokela ingupfu, namwe mtsakuwa iwakalangama wangu ako Yerusalemu, mne tsiisi tsa Yudeya na Samariya, na muisi mwose.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Hayamalitse kulonga apfo kasolighwa kulanga, aku wose womlola, kuya liwingu limghubika nawo ng'awamwonile keli bae.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Hawang'ali wotsodola tsinenge kulanga Yesu hang'ali yakuka, bahala iwanu weli iwapfalile maghwanda matselu wema habehi yawo, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />walonga, “Mwemwe iwanu wa Galilaya! Ebali mwima hano mwolola kulanga? Yesu yuyuno, iyasolighwe kuna mwemwe kughenda kulanga, katsakuya keli ka pfipfo pfammwonile kakuka kulanga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matiasi kosaghulighwa akinde hanu ha Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Kuya iwatumighwa woya Yerusalemu kulawa mne Chidunda cha Mitseituni, utali wa chilomita ka imwe kulawa mkaye. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Hawapfikile mkaye, wengila mne chiheleto cha kuchanya chawang'ali wokalagha. Nawo tsawakala Petiri, Yohane, Yakobu, Andereya, Filipi, Tomasi, Batalomeyo, Matei, Jakobu imwana we Alifayo, Simoni Mkanani na Yuda mwanaghe Jakobu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Awo wose tsawaghendelela kwitingana hamwe ukulomba, hamwe ne iwapinga wangi, na Mariya mai wake Yesu, na ndughu tsake Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Litsuwa limwe mne matsuwa agho, Petiri kema haghati he iwanu iwetingane. Tsawakala iwanu miya imwe na ishilini. <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />Petiri kalonga, “Ndughu tsangu, tsaibamighwa Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghatimile. Ghumwande Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka tsakalonga kubitila Daudi, Daudi tsakatabili mbuli tsa Yuda, iyawalongotse iwanu wala iwamghoghile Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda tsakakala miyetu kwaapfila tsakasaghulighwa na Yesu tusang'ane naye.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Yeye tsakaghula mghunda kwa sendi tsapatile kwa sang'ano yake ila ihile, kaghwa hamo, katulika na usapi wake wose ulawa kunze. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Iwanu wose wa Yerusalemu tsawahulika mbuli atso, apfo mne chilugha chawo waghukema mghunda aghwo Akelidama, mana yake “Mghunda ghwe Idamu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Petiri kalonga, “Kwaapfila yandikighwa mne Tsaburi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Ing'anda yake ikale uchuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">imunu wowose aleke kukala mng'anda amwo.’ Pfipfila yandikighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Imunu yungi yeng'ighwe isang'ano yake ya kulongotsa.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Apfo yobamighwa kumsaghula imunu yumwe kulawa mne iwanu iwelongotse na twetwe matsuwa ghose Imtwatsa Yesu hayang'ali na twetwe, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kulawa Yohane hayang'ali yobatitsa mbaka litsuwa lila Yesu hayasolighwe kulawa kuna twetwe kughenda kulanga. Imunu ayo kobamighwa yawe mkalangama miyetu wa kutsilihuka kwa Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Apfo wasaghula mataghwa meli, Yosefu iyakemighwe Barisaba, pfipfila tsakakemighwa Yusti, na wa keli Matiasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Kuya walomba, “Imtwatsa, ghweghwe kwoimanya imimoyo ye iwanu wose. Lelo utulanguse, imunu yuhi yumsaghule mne iwanu wano weli <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />ili asole isang'ano ye utumighwa yailekile Yuda na kughenda hanu hake imwenyegho.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Kuya watowa simbi, na simbi imghwila Matiasi, naye kongetsighwa mne iwatumighwa wala kumi na yumwe.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ukutsa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Litsuwa lya Pentekoste halipfikile, wose iwamtoghole Yesu tsawetingana hanu hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Bahala, iwanu wahulika chinu choduma kulawa kulanga ka beho liduma kwe ingupfu, limemesa ing'anda yose iwakalile iwanu awo. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Kuya, pfilawila ipfinu ipfikoneka ka milambi ya ghumoto, napfo pfipwililika na kukala mchanya mwa chila imunu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Wose tsawamemesighwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, wandusa kulonga lugha tsingi ka Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka pfayawatendile wadahe kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ako Yerusalemu tsakukala na Wayahudi iwompfuka Imulungu iwalawile chila isi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Hawahulike litsi alyo, iwanu wetingana hamwe. Wose wakangawala kwaapfila chila imunu kawahulika wolonga kwa chilugha chake imwenyegho. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Wakangawala ng'ani, walonga, “Pfii, iwanu wano wose watuwahulika wolonga pfino, si Wagalilaya bae? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ebali lelo, chila imunu mna twetwe kowahulika wolonga chokaye? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Wamwenga twolawila Paritiya, Midiya na Elamu, wamwenga wolawila Mesopotamiya, Yudeya, Kapadokiya, Ponto na isi ya Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Na wamwenga wolawa Firigiya, Pamfiliya, Misiri na kaye tsa Libiya tsili habehi na Kirene, wamwenga wetu wolawila Roma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />na Wayahudi ne iwanu iwengile mne dini ya Chiyahudi, wamwenga wolawila Kirete ne Arabiya. Twetwe wose twowahulika wolonga ipfinu pfikulu pfayatendile Imulungu kwa lugha tsetu iwenyegho.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Wose wakangawala, wapfuka, weghutsa, “Achi nacho choni?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Lekeni iwanu wangi wawabetsa, walonga, “Iwanu wano wapatika!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri Kolonga ne Wanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Kuya Petiri kema nawo iwatumighwa wala kumi na yumwe, kandusa kuwalongela iwanu awo kwa kukemelela, “Wayahudi weyangu, na mwemwe mwose yamkala hano Yerusalemu, mleke niwalongele, namwe mtegheletse ghoya chanilonga. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Iwanu wano ng'awapatike bae ka pfamlonga. Sambi saa tatu nemitondo! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Achino ichilawile chicho chayalongile Yoeli, nabii we Imulungu,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Imulungu kolonga, mne matsuwa gha utsighilo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nitsowamwaghila iwanu wose Ghumuhe ghwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Iwana wenu na neghe tsenu watsopeta mbuli yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">iwasongolo wenu watsakona ghamaono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">ne iwabala wenu watsolota tsindoto.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Hata iwatumwa wangu pfipfila, wose iwamale ne iwapinga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nitsowamwaghila Ghumuhe ghwangu mne matsuwa agho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nawo watsopeta mbuli yangu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Nitsotenda pfihulo uchanya kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">ne ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">kutsakuwa na idamu, ghumoto na hosi tito.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Litsua litsoghaluka kuwa chisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">na lwetsi lutsakuwa ludung'u ka idamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">aho ng'ana lipfike litsuwa lila likulu lye utunitso we Imtwatsa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ne imunu wowose iyatsolomba kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa katsokombolighwa.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Iwanu we Isiraeli, mtegheletse imbuli ino! Yesu wa Natsareti tsakakala imunu yane uwetso iyalangusighwe kuna mwemwe kwe pfihulo, pfinu pfa kukangawatsa ne ipfitango pfatendile Imulungu kuna mwemwe kubitila yeye, ka mwemwe iwenyegho pfammanya. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kulawa mwanduso Imulungu imwenyegho tsakabama Yesu aghoghighwe na mwemwe, namwe mumkoma kwa kuwaleka iwanu wehile wamuwambe mna msalaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Lekeni Imulungu kamtsiliula Yesu, kamkombola kulawa mne usungu we lifwa kwaapfila ng'aidahike bae lifwa limwohe. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Mana Daudi tsakalonga pfino mbuli tsa Yesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Tsanimwona Imtwatsa hambele hangu matsuwa ghose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">Kwaapfila yeye ka habehi hangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">Sitsohighisika bae.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Apfo, ghumoyo ghwangu ghwodeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">lulimi lwangu lolonga kwa kudeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">na lukuli lwangu lutsokala kwa lolelo,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwaapfila ng'utsondeka kutsimu bae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">ng'utsomleka bae Mwenzeluka wako yole mne likabuli.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Kunilangusa inzila ye ughima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">kutsonimemesa ndeng'elo kwaapfila kwa hamwe na nene.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Wandughu, ndekeni nonge mwatsimwatsi mbuli tsa aba wetu mkulu Daudi. Yeye kafa, katsikighwa na likabuli lyake lyabahano mbaka leloli. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Lekeni kwaapfila Daudi tsakakala nabii we Imulungu, kamanya ka Imulungu kelaha kuna yeye ka ang'amtendile mtsukulu wake yumwe yawe imndewa ka pfayakalile Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Daudi tsakalongola kughona agho ighatsotendighwa ne Imulungu, apfo kalonga mbuli tse ukutsilihuka kwa Kiristu Mkombotsi, hala hayalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Ng'alekighwe kutsimu bae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">wala lukuli lwake ng'alolile bae.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />“Imulungu iyo yamtsilihule ayo Yesu, na twetwe twa iwakalangama we chinu acho. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Naye Yesu henulighwe na kwikighwa lubali lwa kujilo lwe Imulungu, kabokela Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kulawa kwa Aba wake ka pfayatulongele. Kuya katughalila Ghumuhe ayo, na acho chicho chamchona sambi na kuchihulika. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kwaapfila si Daudi bae iyasolighwe kughenda kulanga, ila yeye kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Imtwatsa kamlongela Imtwatsa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">ukale hano hane ubali wangu wa kujilo<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mbaka niwatende wehile wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:35">wawe hasi ha ghamaghulu ghako.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Apfo iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wobamighwa wamanye ghendo, Imulungu kamtenda ayu Yesu imumuwambile mna msalaba yawe Imtwatsa na Kiristu Mkombotsi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Iwanu hawahulike agho, ghawahoma ghendo mmoyo, wawaghutsa Petiri na iwatumighwa wangi, “Ndughu tsetu, lelo tutendatse?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petiri kawedika, “Chila imunu yatsileke nzambi tsake, mbatitsighwe kwa taghwa lya Yesu Kiristu, na Imulungu katsomleghusilani nzambi tsenu. Namwe mtsobokela laghano lye Imulungu, iyo Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwaapfila laghano lila tsamwikilighwa mwemwe, na iwana wenu, na iwanu wose iwali kutali na awala wose iwatsokemighwa ne Imtwatsa Imulungu wetu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Kwa mbuli nyingi Petiri kawakomangitsa iwanu, kalonga, “Mwikombole kulawa mweleko ghuno ghuhile.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Iwanu wengi watsitoghola mbuli tsake, wabatitsighwa. Mne litsuwa lila, iwanu ka 3,000 wongetseka. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Awo wose waghendelela kulangulitsighwa ne iwatumighwa wa Yesu, wakala hamwe ka iwandughu, wamegha ichighate na walomba hamwe.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfawakalile awala iwamtoghole Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Iwatumighwa tsawatenda pfihulo na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfingi, chila imunu ang'ali yopfuka. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Iwatoghole wose waghendelela kukala hamwe na kwigholela ipfinu pfawo. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Tsawang'ali wohutsa mali tsawo ne ipfinu pfawo na kwigholela sendi ka chila imunu pfayabamile. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Waghendelela kwitingana mne ing'anda ye Imulungu chila litsuwa. Lekeni hawang'ali womegha chighate, tsawetingana mne tsing'anda tsawo na ukuja ichijo acho kwa ndeng'elo na ghumoyo mtselu. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Tsawamtunitsa Imulungu ne iwanu wose wanoghelesighwa nawo. Na chila litsuwa Imtwatsa yang'ali yowongetsela iwanu iwang'ali wokombolighwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Petiri na Yohane womhonetsa ichimbete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Litsuwa limwe, Petiri na Yohane wang'ali woghenda mne ing'anda ye Imulungu saa tisa nemisi, iwanu hawoghendagha kulomba. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Iwanu tsawang'ali womghalagha imunu yumwe iyakalile chimbete kulawa kwelekighwa kwake. Chila litsuwa iwanu wang'ali womwika imunu ayo mne libani lye ing'anda ye Imulungu ilikemighwe “Libani linoghile” ili yalombe chochose kwe iwanu iwang'ali wakwingila mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Hayawonile Petiri na Yohane wakwingila mng'anda, kawalomba wamwing'e chochose. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Nawo wamtsodolela tsinenge. Kuya Petiri kamlongela, “Tulolese!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Naye kawalola, kalolela kupata ichinu chochose kulawa kuna wawo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Lekeni Petiri kamlongela, “Nahela sendi, ila nokwing'a achila chanili nacho, kwa taghwa lya Yesu Kiristu wa Natsareti, winuke ughende!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Kuya kamkinda ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo, kamwapfila ukwinuka, bahala ghamaghulu, na mbweghele tse imunu ayo tsiwa na ngupfu. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Kadaluka kwa ghamaghulu ghake na kwandusa ukughenda. Kuya kengila nawo mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, koghenda kodaluka daluka aku komtunya Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Iwanu wose hawamwonile koghenda na komtunya Imulungu, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />wamtanga yeye kayuyula iyang'ali yolomba habehi na “Libani linoghile” lye Ing'anda ye Imulungu, weduka, wakangawala kwa achila ichimlawile.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tsa Petiri mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Imunu ayo hang'ali yoghenda na Petiri na Yohane, iwanu wose wang'ali wokangawala na wandusa kutsumila hanu ha kwitinganila hakemighwe “Ukumbi wa Selemani.” <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petiri honile apfi, kawalongela, “Iwanu wa Isiraeli, ebali mwokangawala kwe ichinu chino? Mbona mwotutsodolela tsinenge ka twetwe itumtendile imunu yuno yadahe kughenda kwa ngupfu tsetu iwenyegho au kwaapfila tunogha hambele he Imulungu? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Imulungu wa Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu, Imulungu we iwabala wetu, tsakamtunya Yesu imtumighwa wake, ila mwemwe mumghogha ili yakomighwe, namwe mumlema hambele ha Pilato, lekeni Pilato tsakabama yamlekelele yoke. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Tsakakala Mwenzeluka na imunu yanoghile, lekeni mwemwe mumlema, mumlomba Pilato yamlekelele imunu iyakomile. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mwemwe mumkoma yeye yali mwanduso wa ughima, lekeni Imulungu kamtsilihula kulawa mne lifwa, na twetwe twa wakalangama we ichinu acho. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Kwa kutoghola taghwa lya Yesu, imunu ayu immwona na imummanya keng'ighwa ingupfu. Ukutoghola na taghwa lya Yesu pfimhonetsa ghendo imunu ayu ka wose pfammwona.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Lelo ndughu tsangu, nomanya ka mwemwe ne iwakulu wenu mghatenda agho kwaapfila ng'ammanyile bae. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Lekeni Imulungu katimitsa achila chayalongile ghumwande kubitila manabii wose we Imulungu, ka ibamighwa Kiristu wake yadununzike. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Lelo mtsileke nzambi tsenu mmuyile Imulungu, ili yawaleghusile nzambi tsenu. Mng'atenda apfo, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />mtsakongetsighwa ngupfu tsa muhe kulawa kwe Imtwatsa, naye katsomtuma Yesu Kiristu, iyamsaghulileni. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Kobamighwa akale kulanga mbaka ichipindi che Imulungu kutenda ipfinu pfose pfiwe pfa sambi chipfike, ka pfayalongile ghumwande kubitila manabii wake wahenzeluka. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Kwaapfila Musa tsakalonga, ‘Imtwatsa Imulungu wenu katsomghalileni nabii wake ka pfanighalile nene, ayo katsolawila mghati mwenu mwenyegho, mwobamighwa muhulikitse chila ichinu chayowalongela. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Imunu wowose iyolema kumuhulikitsa nabii ayo, katsobaghulighwa kulawa kwe iwanu we Imulungu na katsokomighwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Wanabii wose we Imulungu, kwanzila Samweli na awala iwatsile hambele, tsawalonga mbuli tse ipfinu ipfilawila mne matsuwa ghano. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Imulungu tsakawalapfila mwemwe laghano kubitila wanabii we Imulungu, namwe mwamghati mwa laghano lila lyatendile Imulungu ne iwabala wenu, ka pfayamlongele Abrahamu, ‘Kubitila mweleko ghwako, nitsowabaliki iwanu wose muisi mwose.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Imulungu hayamtsilihule imtumighwa wake, tanu kamtumilani mwemwe, yawabaliki na yamtende chila yumwe wenu aleke kutenda ghehile.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petiri na Yohane woghalighwa mne libalatsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petiri na Yohane hawang'ali wowalongela iwanu, iwatambika wakulu ne iwakulu wa wakalitsa Ing'anda ye Imulungu hamwe na Masadukayo tsawapfika. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Tsawona maya ng'ani kwaapfila iwatumighwa awo wang'ali wolangulitsa iwanu ka Yesu katsilihuka, ichinu ichikonesa ghendo ka iwanu iwafile watsotsilihuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Apfo wawaghogha Petiri na Yohane, waweka mwigheletsa mbaka ilupfi yake, kwaapfila tsaikala nemihe. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Lekeni iwanu wengi iwahulike imbuli yawailongile Petiri na Yohane watoghola, na iwanu iwatoghole tsawongetseka na kuwa ka iwanu elufu tano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Litsuwa liwinzile, iwakulu wa Wayahudi, iwabala ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wetingana hamwe ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Tsawetingana ne Imtambika mkulu Anasi, Kayafa, Yohane, Alekisanda na iwanu wangi wa lukolo lwa Imtambika mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Tsawaweka hambele hawo, wawaghutsa, “Mwemwe mtenda ichinu chino kwa ingupfu yachi na kwa taghwa lya nani?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Kuya Petiri, aku kamema Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, kawedika, “Mwemwe iwakulu ne iwabala we iwanu! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Mng'atughutsa leloli kwa chinu chila chinoghile chayatendelighwe imunu yula chimbete, na pfahonile, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />iwanu wose wa Isiraeli mwobamighwa mmanye ka imunu ayu iyemile hano hambele henu, kamghima ghendo kwe ingupfu ya taghwa lya Yesu Kiristu wa Natsareti, yula imumuwambile mna msalaba na Imulungu iyamtsilihule kulawa mne lifwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu iyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Libwe lyamlemile mwemwe iwatsenga ng'anda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">sambi liwa libwe kulu lya ukwalambatsa.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Yeye yaliyeka iyodaha kuwakombola iwanu, kwaapfila mne isi yose kuduhu taghwa lyatwing'ighwe twetwe tukombolighwe nalyo.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Iwabala awo wa libalatsa tsawamanya ka Petiri na Yohane tsawakala iwanu mbughilambughila ing'awasomile bae, apfo wakangawala kuwona pfawalongile pfinoghile, wamanya kuwa wahamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Lekeni kwaapfila wamwona imunu yahonetsighwe kema hamwe na Petiri na Yohane, ng'awadahile bae kulonga ichinu chochose. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Apfo wawalaghitsa walawe kunze kwe libalatsa, kuya wandusa kwilongetsa iwenyegho. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Weghutsa, “Tuwatende choni iwanu wano? Chila imunu iyokala Yerusalemu komanya kuwa watenda chihulo chikulu, na twetwe ng'atudaha bae kubela. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Lekeni ili imbuli ino ileke kwenela ng'ani kwe iwanu, tuwakanye waleke kulonga keli ne imunu wowose kwa taghwa lya Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Kuya wawakema keli mng'anda, wawalaghitsa waleke kulonga keli na kulangulitsa kwa taghwa lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Lekeni Petiri na Yohane wawedika, “Mlamle mwemwe muwenyegho, chihi ichinoghile kwe Imulungu, kuwahulikitsa mwemwe au kumuhulikitsa Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kwaapfila ng'atudaha bae kuleka kulonga aghala ghatwonile na ghatuhulike.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Kuya iwabala awo wa libaratsa wawakanya ghendo na kuwalekelela. Ng'awadahile bae kuweng'a atsabu kwaapfila iwanu wose wakala womtunitsa Imulungu kwa achila ichilawile. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Imunu ayo iyahonetsighwe tsakakala imbala wa kubita miyaka alubaini.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwamtoghole Yesu wolomba wongetsighwe ingupfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bahala Petiri na Yohane hawalekilighwe, woya kwa weyawo, wawalongela achila chawalongelighwe ne iwatambika wakulu ne iwabala. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Nawo hawahulike imbuli ayo wamlomba Imulungu kwa ghumoyo ghumwe. “Imtwatsa, ghweghwe kwa Maumba yulumbile kulanga na iisi, ne ibahali na pfose ipfili mumo! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Tsakulonga kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kubitila kwa imtumighwa wako, aba wetu Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Ebali wanu wali muisi waghudubuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Mbona iwanu wokwalangula ipfinu ipfilihela mana?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Iwandewa we iisi weyandaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">ne iwatawala watingana hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">kumpinga Imtwatsa na Kiristu wake.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Kwaapfila Herodi, Pontiyo Pilato, iwanu we Isiraeli ne iwanu iwali si Wayahudi watingana mne ghumji ghuno kumpinga Yesu, Imtumighwa wako Mwenzeluka, yumsaghule yawe Kiristu. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Tsawatingana watenda aghala ghubamile kulawa ghumwande kwa uwetso wako ghalawile. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Lelo ghwe Imtwatsa, ulole pfawatutenda tupfuke, utwapfile twetwe iwatumwa wako tudahe kulonga imbuli yako bila kupfuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Gholosa ghumoko ghwako kuhonetsa iwanu, utende ipfitango na pfihulo kwa taghwa lya Yesu Imtumighwa wako Mwenzeluka.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Hawamalitse kulomba, hanu hala hawatinganile tsahahighisighwa. Wose wamemesighwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, na waghendelela kulonga imbuli ye Imulungu bila kupfuka.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwamtoghole Yesu tsawakala ka iwanu wa lukolo lumwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Iwanu wose iwatoghole tsawakala na ghumoyo ghumwe na tsawalangula chinu chimwe. Kuduhu imunu wowose iyalongile ka ichinu iyalinacho chake aliyeka, ila wegholela ipfinu pfose pfawakalile napfo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Iwatumighwa waghendelela kulonga kwa ngupfu Imbuli ya ukutsilihuka kwa Yesu, na Imulungu kawabaliki ghendo. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Tsahaduhu imunu wowose iyakalile kahela ichinu. Iwanu iwakalile ne imighunda au tsing'anda tsawang'ali wohutsa, na waghala sendi <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />kwe iwatumighwa, nawo tsawatsighola kwa chila imunu ka pfayabamile.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Tsakukala na Mlawi yumwe iyolawila Kupulo, iyakemighwe Yosefu. Iwatumighwa tsawamwing'a taghwa Balinaba, mana yake “Mghuma ghumoyo iwanu” <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Ayu tsakakala na mghunda, kauhutsa, kasola sendi atso katsighala kwe iwatumighwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiya na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Tsakukala ne imunu yumwe iyakemighwe Ananiya na mwehe wake Safila. Nawo pfipfila tsawahutsa mghunda ghwawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Lekeni Ananiya kabaghula sendi tsingi katsifisa, aku mwehe wake kapfimanya. Sendi itsisighale katsighala kwe iwatumighwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Petiri kamghutsa, “Ananiya, ebali kumleka Setani yengile mmoyo mwako, na kukutenda umghutsukile Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, kwa kupfisa sendi tsingi tsupatile kwa kuhutsa mghunda? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Pfii mghunda ng'aghukalile ghwako bae hala ng'ana ghuhutsighwe? Na hauutsile sendi atso ambe tsikala tsako, utsitendele chochose choubama. Ebali lelo kulamla kutenda ichinu chino? Ng'umghutsukile imunu bae, ila kumghutsukila Imulungu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Bahala Ananiya hayahulike apfo, kaghwa hasi, kafa. Iwanu wose iwahulike imbuli ayo wapfuka ng'ani. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Kuya iwasongolo watsa, walupfatsa sanda lukuli lwake, wamlapfa kunze, wamtsika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Masaa madatu haghabitile, mwehe wake naye kengila, ng'amanyile bae aghala ighalawile. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petiri kamghutsa, “Unongele, atsino tsitso sendi tsose tsampatile ghweghwe na mmale wako kwa kuhutsa mghunda ghwenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Naye kedika, “Ona, tsitso.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Petiri kamlongela, “Ebali ghweghwe na mmale wako mlamula kumghetsa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka ghwe Imtwatsa? Tegheletsa, iwanu iwamtsikile mmale wako, sambi wa hane libani, nawo pfipfila watsokusola ghweghwe!” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Bahala ipinga ayo kaghwa mmaghulu mwa Petiri, kafa. Kuya iwasongolo wala wengila, wampfika ma kafa. Apfo wamlapfa naye kunze, wamtsika habehi na mmale wake. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Iwanu wose iwamtoghole Yesu ne iwanu wangi iwahulike mbuli atso wapfuka ng'ani.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwatumighwa wowahonetsa iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Iwatumighwa tsawatenda pfihulo na pfinu pfingi pfa kukangawatsa mghati mwe iwanu. Na iwanu wose iwatoghole wang'ali wotingana hamwe mne chitala cha mtingano cha Selemani. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Kuduhu imunu wowose ing'ayamtoghole Yesu iyaghetsile kwilunga nawo. Hata apfo, iwanu wangi tsawang'ali wowatunya. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Iwanu iwamtoghole Imtwatsa wang'ali wakongetseka ng'ani, iwamale ne iwapinga. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Mbaka iwanu wang'ali wowaghala iwatamu mne tsinzila na kuwawasisa mlutsatsi na mne ghamatemvu ili Petiri ang'abita sisila lyake liwabitile wangi wawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Iwanu wengi, iwalawile mne miwambo ya habehi na Yerusalemu watsa, wawaghala iwatamu na iwanu wane ipfinyamkela, nawo wose wahonetsighwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwatumighwa wodununzighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Kuya Imtambika mkulu na weyaghe, iwanu we chikingili cha Masadukayo wa hanu hala, wawonela chepfu iwatumighwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Wawaghogha Iwatumighwa, wawoha mwigheletsa. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Lekeni nechilo malaika we Imtwatsa kapfughula imibani ya ligheletsa, kawalapfa kunze, kawalongela, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Mghende, mkeme mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, muwalongele iwanu imbuli yose ye ughima uno wa sambi.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Iwatumighwa wahulikitsa, kuya nemitondotondo wengila mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, wandusa kulangulitsa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Imtambika mkulu na weyaghe hawapfikile, wawakema hamwe iwanu we libaratsa kulu lye iwabala we Isiraeli, kuya wawatuma iwanu mchifungo wawaghalile iwatumighwa wala. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />lekeni iwanu wala hawapfikile ako, ng'awawapfikile bae iwatumighwa wa Yesu mwigheletsa. Apfo woya mne libaratsa na kuwalongela imbuli ayo, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />walonga, “Tupfika ligheletsa lihindighwa pfipfila, na iwakalitsi wokalitsa imibani. Lekeni hatufughule imibani, ng'atumpfikile imunu wowose mng'anda.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Imkulu we iwokalitsa ing'anda ye Imulungu ne iwatambika wakulu hawahulike imbuli ayo, wakangawala ichinu chachi ichiwapatile iwatumighwa wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Kuya imunu yumwe katsa, kawalongela, “Iwanu wala yamuwekile mwigheletsa, sambi wamne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, wowalangulitsa iwanu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Baho imbala we iwokalitsa ing'anda ye Imulungu hamwe ne iwanu wake waghenda mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, wawasola na kuwaghala mne libaratsa. Lekeni ng'awawaghoghile bae kwe ingupfu, kwaapfila wawapfuka iwanu wang'awatowile na ghamabwe.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Kuya wawaghala iwatumighwa wa Yesu na kuwemisa hambele ha libaratsa. Imtambika mkulu kawaghutsa, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Ambe tuwaghoma mwemwe ukulangulitsa kwa taghwa lye imunu ayu, lelo mlole achi chamtendile! Mghenetsa ghamalangulitso ghenu Yerusalemu yose na mwobama kulonga twetwe iwo itumtendile yafe!”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petiri na iwatumighwa wala wangi wedika, “Twobamighwa tumhulikitse Imulungu, si iwanu bae! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Imulungu we iwabala wetu kamtsilihula Yesu, imumkomile kwa kumuwamba mna msalaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Imulungu kamwinula mbaka lubali lwake lwe kujilo, kawa Chilongotsi ne Mkombotsi, awatende iwanu we Isiraeli watsileke nzambi ili Imulungu awaleghusile nzambi tsawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Twetwe twa iwakalangama we ipfinu pfino, na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka Imulungu iyaweng'ile iwanu wose iwomhulikitsa, naye ka mkalangama wa chinu chino.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Iwanu wose wa libaratsa hawahulike apfo, wona maya ghendo, wabama wawakome iwatumighwa awo wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Lekeni Mfarisayo yumwe taghwa lyake Gamalieli, mlangulitsa ghamalaghitso yahulikitsighwe ne iwanu wose, kema hambele he libaratsa, kabama iwatumighwa wala walapfighwe kunze chidogho. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Kuya kawalongela iwanu wa libaratsa, “Waisiraeli weyangu mwalangitse ichinu ichimbama kuwatendela iwanu wano! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ghumwande chidogho tsakalawila imunu yumwe taghwa lyake Teuda, tsakalonga yeye ka imunu mkulu, ne iwanu ka miya nne tsawamuwinza. Lekeni kakomighwa, ne iwanu wake wose wapwililika na imbuli yake imalila baho. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Kuya matsuwa ghala gha kupetighwa iwanu, tsakalawila Yuda wa Galilaya. Ayo naye tsakalongotsa iwanu wengi, lekeni naye pfipfila kakomighwa, ne iwanu wake wose iwamuwinzile wapwililika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Lelo nowalongela mleke kuwatendela ichinu chochose chihile, muwalekele woke! Kwaapfila ka ichinu chino ne isang'ano ino ilawa kwe iwanu, itsomala. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Lekeni ka ilawa kwe Imulungu, mwemwe ng'amdaha bae kuwatenda iwanu wano waileke mbuli yawo, pfipfila mtsokuwa mwesonga ne Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Iwanu wose we libaratsa watoghola chayalongile Gamalieli. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Wawakema iwatumighwa wala mng'anda, walamla watowighwe ipfiboko na wawaghoma waleke ukulangulitsa keli kwa taghwa lya Yesu, kuya wawalekelela woke. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Iwatumighwa wala walawa kunze mwa libaratsa wodeng'elela kwaapfila ibamighwa wapate chinyala kwaajili ya taghwa lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Tsawaghendelela chila litsuwa ukulangulitsa ne ukupeta Imbuli Inoghile mne ing'anda ye Imulungu na mmakaye mwe iwanu ka Yesu iye Kiristu Mkombola.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu saba wosaghulighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Hambele, iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu hawang'ali wakongetseka, tsakulawila manung'uniko mghati mwe iwomtoghola Yesu iwolonga Chigiriki, na awala iwolonga Chihebulaniya. Awala iwolonga Chigiriki tsawanung'unika ka iwasaka wawo wang'ali wosemighwa mne ukugholelighwa ipfijo pfa chila litsuwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Apfo iwatumighwa wala kumi na weli wawakema iwanu wose iwamtoghole Yesu, walonga, “Ng'apfinoghile bae twetwe kuleka kupeta imbuli ye Imulungu ili kutenda isang'ano ya kughola ipfijo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Apfo ndughu tsetu, msaghule iwanu saba mghati mwenu iwomanyika wamema Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka na wane ihekima, na twetwe tutsoweng'a isang'ano ino. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Kuya twetwe tutsolomba na kutenda isang'ano ya kupeta Imbuli ye Imulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Imbuli ayo iwadeng'eletsa iwanu wose iwomtoghola Yesu. Wawasaghula Stefani, imunu iyotoghola ghendo na yamemile Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, Filipi na Porokoro na Nikanori na Timona na Parimena na Nikolayo iyolawila Antiyokiya, iyengile mne dini ya Chiyahudi hao mwanduso. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Waweka hambele he iwatumighwa, nawo wawalombela na kuwekila ghamoko.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Imbuli ye Imulungu ighendelela kwenela na iwanu iwatoghole tsawongetseka ng'ani ako Yerusalemu, na iwatambika wengi nawo watoghola.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefani koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Stefani imunu iyabalikighwe ng'ani na kwing'ighwa ingupfu ne Imulungu, tsakatenda pfihulo na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa mghati mwe iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Lekeni iwanu wangi we ing'anda ye ukulombela iikemighwe Ing'anda ye iwanu iwalekelighwe, iwalawile Kirene, Alekisandiliya na wangi iwalawile Kilikiya na Asiya, wandusa kwihisanya na Stefani. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kamwing'a Stefani inzewele, hayang'ali yolonga ng'awadahile bae kumuhuma. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Apfo wawasongetsa iwanu wangi walonge, “Tumuhulika Stefani kolonga mbuli tsa kuwaligha Musa ne Imulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kwa kutenda apfi, wawasongesa iwanu, iwabala ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Apfo wamghogha Stefani wamghala mwibaratsa. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Kuya wawaghala iwakalangama we ughutsu iwalongile, “Imunu yuno ng'oleka bae kuhalonga pfihile hanu hano haenzeluke na kughalonga pfihile Ghamalaghitso gha Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Kwaapfila tsatumuhulika kolonga ayo Yesu wa Natsareti katsohahinya hanu hano na kuchighelusa ichihendo ichatubokele kwa Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wose iwakalile mne libaratsa lila wamtsodolela tsinenge Stefani, wawona uhanga wake wakoneka ka uhanga wa malaika.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Stefani kolonga ne iwanu wa libaratsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Kuya Imtambika mkulu kamghutsa Stefani, “Pfii mbuli tsino tsolongesa?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Naye Stefani kedika, “Ndughu tsangu ne aba tsangu mnitegheletse! Aba wetu Abrahamu hayang'ali ng'ana yaghende kukala Harani, Imulungu we utunitso tsakamlawila akula Mesopotamiya. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Imulungu kamlongela, ‘Ileke isi yako, waleke iwanu wa lukolo lwako, ughende kune isi yanitsokulangusa.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Baho Abrahamu kaileka isi ya Kalidayo, kaghenda kukala Harani. Aba wake hayafile, Imulungu kamlapfa Harani katsa kukala mne isi ino yamkala sambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Imulungu ng'amwing'ile bae hata hanu hadoghodogho he isi ino hawe hanu hake, hata apfo tsakamlongela katsomwing'a isi ino iwe yake na iwe ye iwanaghe, hata ka matsuwa agho ng'akalile ne imwana bae. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Imulungu kamlongela pfino, ‘Iwana wako watsoghalighwa kune isi iitawalighwa ne iwanu wangi, ako watsotendighwa iwatumwa, na kutendighwa ghehile kwa miyaka maghana mane. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Lekeni nene nitsowahigha iwanu we isi ayo iitsowatenda mwemwe iwatumwa. Kuya nitsowalapfa mne isi ayo watse hanu ano wanitamanile.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Kuya Imulungu kamwing'a Abrahamu chihendo cha kwingitsa ngoma chiwe chitango che laghano lyake. Apfo Abrahamu kamwingitsa ngoma imwanaghe Isaka litsuwa lya nane kulawa hayoneke. Na Isaka pfipfila kamwingitsa ngoma imwanaghe Yakobu. Naye Yakobu kawatendela pfipfo awala iwabala wetu kumi na weli.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Kwaapfila awala iwabala wetu tsawamwonela chepfu Yosefu, wamhutsa yawe mtumwa mne isi ya Misiri. Lekeni Imulungu tsakakala hamwe naye, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />kamlapfa mne maghayo ghake ghose. Imulungu kamwing'a ihekima, kamtenda amnoghele Farao imndewa wa Misiri, na imndewa ayo kamwika Yosefu yawe imbala we isi na ing'anda yake ya undewa. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Kuya kulawila nzala ng'ulu mne isi yose ya Misiri na Kanani, nzala ayo itenda iwanu wadununzike ng'ani. Iwabala wetu ng'awadahile bae kupata ichijo chochose. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Yakobu hayahulike ka ako Misiri tsakukala ne ichijo, kawatuma iwanaghe, iwabala wetu, waghende ako Misiri kwa ghumwanza ghwa mwanduso. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Mne ghumwanza ghwa kabili, Yosefu tsakawalongela ndughu tsake yeye tsakakala nani, na mndewa wa Misiri kawamanya iwandughu wa Yosefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yosefu tsakatuma iwanu wamkeme Yakobu, aba wake ne iwandughu tsake watse Misiri, iwanu wose tsawakala sabini na watano. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Apfo Yakobu tsakaghenda Misiri, yeye ne iwabala wetu wangi tsawafila kuko. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Imitufi yawo ighalighwa mbaka Shekemu, itsikighwa mne likabuli lyaghulile Abrahamu kwa sendi kulawa kwa kabila lya Hamori.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Ghamatsuwa haghapfikile Imulungu kutimitsa laghano lyamwing'ile Abrahamu, iwanu tsawongetseka na kuwa wengi ng'ani akula Misiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Kuya imndewa yungi, yang'ammanyile bae Yosefu kanza kutawala ako Misiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Tsakawatendela iwanu wetu pfihile, na kawonela iwabala wetu kwa kuwalaghitsa wawase kunze iwana wawo pfing'ele wafe. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Musa tsakelekighwa mna ghamatsuwa agho. Tsakakala imwana yanoghile ng'ani. Tsakalelighwa mkaye kwa miyetsi midatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />na hayalapfighwe kunze, neghe Farao kamsola, kamlela ka imwanaghe. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa tsakalangulitsighwa ipfinu pfose na ihekima yose ya Wamisiri na yang'ali yomanyika kwa kulonga na kwa kusang'ana.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Hayakalile ne imiyaka alubaini, kalamla kughenda kuwona ndughu tsake Waisiraeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ako kamwona ndughu yake yumwe kotendighwa pfihile na Mmisiri, kaghenda kumwapfila na kwa kuliha chisasi, kamkoma Mmisiri yula. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Tsakapfikitsa Waisiraeli weyaghe wang'amanyile ka Imulungu tsakakala komtumila yeye kuwakombola, lekeni ng'awamanyile bae. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Litsuwa liwinzile kawona Waisiraeli weli wetowa, kabama kuwalamlitsa, kawalongela, ‘Wayangu, mwemwe mwa wandughu, ebali lelo mwobama kwilagha?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />“Lekeni imunu yula iyang'ali yomlagha myaghe kamkunughitsa Musa kalonga, ‘Angu nani yakwikile ghweghwe uwe ichilongotsi na mlamutsi wetu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Pfii lelo kwobama ung'ome ka pfumkomile Mmisiri yula ligholo?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Musa hahulike apfo, katsuma kaghenda kukala mne isi ya Midiyani. Ako tsakapata iwana weli.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Haibitile imiyaka alubaini, malaika we Imtwatsa kamlawila Musa mne chibagho iching'ali chakwaka ghumoto akula kunyika, habehi na chidunda cha Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa tsakakangawala ukona ichinu acho, kasoghela habehi alolese ghoya, lekeni kahulika litsi lye Imtwatsa. <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Nene na Imulungu wa aba tsako, Nene na Imulungu we Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu.’ Musa kadedema kwa ukupfuka, kuya ng'aghendelele kulola keli. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Imtwatsa kamlongela, ‘Tsula imikwabatsa yako kwaapfila hanu ano hawimile haenzeluka. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nighona ghendo ghehile ghawotendighwa iwanu wangu akula Misiri. Nihulika chililo chawo, na nene nitsa kuwakombola. Lelo nitsokutuma uye Misiri.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Ayuno Musa yuyula yawamlemile iwanu we Isiraeli, hawamlongele, ‘Angu nani yakwikile ghweghwe uwe ichilongotsi na mlamutsi wetu?’ Kubitila malaika yuyula iyamlawile Musa mne chibagho iching'ali chakwaka ghumoto, Imulungu kamtuma Musa yuyo yawe ichilongotsi na mkombotsi. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Yeye iyawalongotse iwanu wala walawe Misiri kwa kutenda pfihulo na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa mne isi ya Misiri, mne ibahali ya Shamu, na kwa miyaka alubaini kunyika. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa yuyo iyawalongele iwanu we Isiraeli, ‘Imulungu katsowaghalilani nabii wake ka nene kulawa mghati mwe iwandughu tsenu.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Yeye iyo iyakalile ne mtingano akula kunyika, na ayula malaika iyalongile naye akula kune chidunda cha Sinai, kuya hamwe ne iwabala tsetu, yuyo iyabokele mbuli tse ughima yatwing'e twetwe.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Lekeni iwabala wetu tsawalema kumuhulikitsa, wamkunughitsila kutali, mmoyo mwawo wabama kuya Misiri. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Wamlongela Aruni, ‘Ututendele milungu iidaha kutulongosa mnzila, kwaapfila ng'atumanyile bae ghayampatile Musa iyatulongotse kulawa Misiri.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Baho watenda ichinyagho che imwana wa ng'ombe, wachilapfila nambiko na kuchitendela ichihungo ichinu chawatendile kwa ghamoko ghawo wenyegho. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Lekeni Imulungu kahunduka koka mghati mwawo, kawaleka watsitamanile tsinondo tsa kulanga ka pfayandikighwe mne ichitabu che manabii we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Mwemwe iwanu we Isiraeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">Si nene bae iyamnichinjile iwanyama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">na kunitambikila kwa imiyaka alubaini akula kunyika?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Mwemwe tsa mchighala ichibumbulika cha mlungu Moleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">na ichinyagho che inondo ye mlungu wenu Refani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">tsapfikala pfinyagho pfamtendile ili mpfitamanile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Apfo nitsowaghala kune utumwa kutali kubita Babeli.’,<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Hakula kunyika iwabala wetu wakala na ichibumbulika chila che ukalangama. Tsachitsengighwa ka Imulungu pfayamlongele Musa achitsenge, chighale na achila chayalangusighwe Musa <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Kuya iwabala wetu webokela chibumbulika acho, iwenyegho kwe iwenyegho mbaka ichipindi cha Yoshua, hawaisolile isi ila kulawa kune isi tsila Imulungu iyatsiwingile hambele hawo. Chikala baho mbaka ghamatsuwa gha Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Daudi tsakanoghelighwa ne Imulungu, naye Daudi kamlomba Imulungu amleke amtsengele ing'anda yeye Imulungu wa Yakobu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Lekeni iyamtsengele ing'anda Imulungu tsakakala Selemani.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Lekeni Imulungu Yali Mkulu ng'okala bae mne tsing'anda itsitsengighwe ne iwanu, ka nabii wake pfayalongile, <verse eid="ACT 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Imtwatsa kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Kulanga kwa chighoda changu che undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na iisi iyo hanu hakwikila ghamaghulu ghangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Ing'anda yachi imdaha kunitsengela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Na hanu he ukubwihila nene halikwani?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Si nene imwenyegho bae nitendile ghano ghose?’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Stefani tsakaghendelela kulonga, “Mwemwe mwa wasughu! Maghutwi ne imimoyo yenu pfighala ne iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu, mwemwe ka iwabala tsenu. Ghamatsuwa ghose mwotsilema mbuli tse Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Angu kuna nabii wowose we Imulungu iwabala tsenu yang'awamdununze bae? Tsawawakoma awala Mulungu yawatumile umwande walonge ukutsa kwa yula yane haki, yamumuhunduke na kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mwemwe iwo imbokele laghitso lye Imulungu imghalilighwe ne wamalaika lekeni ng'amtenda ka pfalilonga.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefani kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Iwabala wala wa libaratsa hawahulike agho, ghawahoma mmoyo, waghudubuka wadafuna matsino kwa kona maya. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Lekeni Stefani aku kamema Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, kalola kulanga kawona utunitso we Imulungu na Yesu kema lubali lwe kujilo lwe Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Kalonga, “Loleni! Nakona kulanga kupfughuka, ne imwana we Imunu kema lubali lwa kujilo lwe Imulungu!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Baho, iwanu wose iwakalile mne libaratsa lila waghadiwa maghutwi ghawo na kukemelela. Kuya wose wamghendela hamwe, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />wamlapfa kunze mwe ghumji wandusa kumtowa na ghamabwe. Iwakalangama tsaweka ghamaghwanda ghawo mne ghamaghulu ghe imsongolo yumwe iyakemighwe Sauli aghalolese. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Hawang'ali womtowa na ghamabwe, Stefani kalomba, “Imtwatsa Yesu, ubokele muhe wangu.”<figure style="fig" file="19 Being Stoned.jpg" size="col" ref="7:59">Stefani kotowighwa ghamabwe</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Tsakatowa ghamaghoti, kakemelela, “Imtwatsa! Uwaleghusile nzambi ino.” Hayamalitse kulonga apfo, kafa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Naye Sauli tsakona pfinogha kukomighwa kwa Stefani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sauli kowadununza iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Litsuwa lilila iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu wa Yerusalemu wandusa kudununzika ng'ani, iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu wose wapwililikila isi ya Yudeya na Samariya, ila iwatumighwa waliheka iwasighale. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Iwanu iwomnoghela Imulungu wamtsika Stefani, kuya wamlilila ng'ani.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Lekeni Sauli kandusa kuwadununza iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu. Kengila chila ing'anda, kawalapfa kunze iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu iwamale ne iwapinga, kaweka mwigheletsa.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli Inoghile yopetighwa mne isi ya Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Awala iwapwililike, tsawapeta Imbuli Inoghile chila hanu hawaghendile. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipi kaghenda mne isi ya Samariya, kawapetela iwanu imbuli ya Kiristu. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Iwanu hawahulike na kwona aghala ghakukangawatsa ghayatendile Filipi, wose wahulikitsa ghoya chayang'ali yochilonga. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ipfinyamkela wawalawa iwanu wengi kwa kukemelela, na iwanu wengi iwaholole na ipfimbete tsawahona. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Apfo tsa kukala na ndeng'elelo ng'ulu mne isi ayo.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Kuya tsahana imunu yumwe yakemighwe Simoni, iyatendile uhawi mne isi ayo, na kuwakangawatsa Wasamariya. Tsakalonga yeye ka imunu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Na iwanu wose, iwabala na iwadodo wang'ali womuhulikitsa ghendo, walonga, “Imunu yuno ka ingupfu ye Imulungu iimanyika ‘Ingupfu Ng'ulu’.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Wamuhulikitsa kwaapfila ang'ali yowakangawatsa kwa uhawi wake kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Lekeni hawatoghole imbuli inoghile ya undewa we Imulungu na imbuli ya Yesu Kiristu iyawapetele Filipi, wose wabatitsighwa, iwamale ne iwapinga. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Hata Simoni imwenyegho tsakatoghola na ukubatitsighwa na tsayang'ali yomuwinza Filipi chila hanu na kukangawala kwa pfihulo ipfing'ali pfitendeka.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Iwatumighwa wala iwakalile Yerusalemu hawahulike ka iwanu wa Samariya waitoghola imbuli ye Imulungu, wawatuma ako Petiri na Yohane. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Hawapfikile wawalombela iwanu awo wambokele Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kwaapfila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka tsakakala ng'ana yamhulumkile imunu wowose mghati mwawo, ila tsawabatitsighwa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa Yesu liliyeka. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Kuya Petiri na Yohane wawekela ghamoko iwanu awo, nawo wambokela Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni honile iwanu weng'ighwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kwa kwikighwa ghamoko ne iwatumighwa, kabama yaweng'e sendi Petiri na Yohane, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />kawalongela, “Mngaye na nene uwetso awo ili imunu wowose yanimwikila ghamoko yambokele Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Lekeni Petiri kamwidika, “Waghile kutali na sendi tsako kwaapfila kwopfikitsa kodaha kughula nzawadi ye Imulungu kwa sendi! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Kwahela chinu chochose mna ing'onde hino, kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwako ng'aghunoghile bae kwe Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Lelo, utoghole kuleka ghehile, umlombe Imtwatsa, naye kodaha kukuleghusila nzambi ya ukwalangula ghano mmoyo mwako. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kwaapfila nokwona kuna usungu sideke na kwohighwa na nzambi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Kuya Simoni kawalongela Petiri na Yohane, “Mnilombele kwe Imtwatsa aghano ghamlongile ghaleke kundawila.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Hawamalitse kuwalongela pfawommanya Yesu na kupeta imbuli ye Imtwatsa, Petiri na Yohane woya Yerusalemu. Hawang'ali wakuya, tsawapeta Imbuli Inoghile mne tsikaye tsa Samariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipi kombatitsa imkulu yumwe we Esiopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Malaika we Imtwatsa kamlongela Filipi, “Ughende lubali lwa hasi kune inzila ye kunyika iihulumka kulawa Yerusalemu kughenda Gatsa” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Filipi kandusa ukuka na mnzila ketingana ne imunu yumwe mwika tsimali mne undewa wa Kandake, imtawala pinga we isi ya Esiopiya. Imunu ayo tsakaghenda Yerusalemu kutamanila. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Hayang'ali yakuya ukaye, tsakakala mne mtuka wake kosoma ichitabu cha Isaya, nabii we Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kamlongela Filipi, “Ghenda habehi ne mtuka ghula, wilongotse nawo.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Kuya Filipi katsumila kune mtuka ula, kamuhulika imunu ayo kosoma ichitabu che nabii Isaya. Baho Filipi kamghutsa, “Pfii koghamanya agho ghausoma?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Naye kalonga, “Angu nidahatse kughamanya bila imunu wa kunilongotsa?” Kamlomba Filipi adine mne mtuka ghula, kakala naye. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Imunu ayo tsayang'ali yosoma hanu hano he Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Tsakakala ka ing'olo iyoghalighwa kuchinjighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">ka imwana we ing'olo pfayonyamala hayoghanighwa imighala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">naye ng'alongile imbuli. <verse eid="ACT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kaghelighwa chinyala na ukwonelighwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Haduhu imunu yodaha kulonga mbuli tsa ghumweleko ghwake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Kwaapfila ughima wake uleghusighwa mne isi yose.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Imunu ayo wa Esiopiya kamlongela Filipi, “Unongele lelo, nabii we Imulungu yolonga mbuli tsa nani? Tsake imwenyegho au tse imunu yungi?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Kuya Filipi kanzila hanu aho ha Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, kamlongela Imbuli Inoghile ya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Hawang'ali woghendelela na ghumwanza, tsawapfika hanu hane ghamatsi, imunu yula kalonga, “Hanu hano hana ghamatsi, lelo chinu chachi ichingoma ndeke kubatitsighwa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipi kalonga, “Ung'atoghola kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghose kodaha kubatitsighwa.” Naye kalonga, “Notoghola Yesu Kiristu iyo Imwana we Imulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Imunu yula kalaghitsa mtuka ghula ghwime. Kuya wose weli wengila mne ghamatsi, naye Filipi kambatitsa.<figure style="fig" file="20 Baptism.jpg" size="col" ref="8:38">Imunu wa Esiopiya kobatitsighwa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Hawalawile mne ghamatsi, bahala Ghumuhe ghwe Imtwatsa kamsola Filipi, imunu yula wa Esiopiya ng'amwonile keli bae, lekeni kaghendelela na ghumwanza ghwake aku kodeng'elela. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Hambele Filipi tsakoneka Asoto, na hayang'ali yobita, kapeta Imbuli Inoghile mne tsiisi tsose mbaka kapfika Kaisariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli komtoghola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Matsuwa ghagho Sauli tsakaghendelela kuwatenda iwanu iwamtoghole Imtwatsa wapfuke ghendo kwa kulonga katsowakoma. Kaghenda kwa mtambika mkulu, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />kalomba yeng'ighwe tsibaluwa itsimwapfila kumanyika mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela itsili Damasko, ili ang'awapfika ako awaghoghe iwamale ne iwapinga iwoiwinza Imbuli ye Imtwatsa na kuya nawo Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Lekeni hayang'ali mnzila habehi na kupfika Damasko, bahala lumwesa kulawa kulanga lummulika kosekose. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Kaghwa, kahulika litsi lyomlongela, “Sauli, Sauli! Ebali kwondesa?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sauli kaghutsa, “Imtwatsa, ghweghwe uli nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Naye kamwidika, “Nene na Yesu, yumdununza! <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Lelo winuke, wingile mne ghumji, ako kuna imunu katsokulongela chokutenda.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Iwanu iwelongotse na Sauli mne ghumwanza wema baho aku wahela chakulonga, wahulika litsi ila ng'awamwonile munu bae. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli kenuka, hayafumbule tsinenge, ng'adahile bae ukwona chochose. Apfo wamlongotsa kwa kumkinda ghumoko mbaka Damasko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Kwa matsuwa madatu Sauli ng'adahile bae ukona, na ng'ajile wala ng'anwile ichinu chochose.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ako Damasko tsahana imunu yumwe iyamuwinzile Yesu, taghwa lyake Ananiya. Imtwatsa tsakamlongela mne ghamaono, “Ananiya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Ananiya kedika, “Ona Mtwatsa.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Imtwatsa kamlongela, “Winuke, ughende kune inzila iikimeghwa inzila iigholoke, ukambame imunu yumwe wa Taso iyokemighwa Sauli, kamne ing'anda ya Yuda, sambi kolomba, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />naye mne ghamaono kamwona imunu iyokemighwa Ananiya kakwingila mng'anda na kumwikila ghamoko ili yadahe ukwona keli.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Lekeni Ananiya kedika, “Imtwatsa nihulika mbuli tse imunu ayu kulawa kwe iwanu wengi. Nihulika mengi ghehile ghayawatendele iwanu wako ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Naye katsa hano ne uwetso kulawa kwe iwatambika wakulu awaghoghe wose iwokutamanila ghweghwe.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Lekeni Imtwatsa kamlongela, “Ghenda, kwaapfila nimsaghula imunu yuno yanisang'anile, yapete taghwa lyangu kwa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi na kwe iwandewa wawo na kwe iwanu we Isiraeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nene imwenyegho nitsomlangusa mengi ighatsombama yadununzike kwaajili ya taghwa lyangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Apfo Ananiya kaghenda, kengila mng'anda amwo. Kuya kamwikila ghamoko Sauli, kalonga, “Ndughu yangu Sauli, Imtwatsa Yesu iyakulawile mnzila haung'ali kwakutsa hano, kanituma ili udahe ukwona keli na umemesighwe Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Bahala ipfinu ka maghamba pfilaghala kulawa mnenge mwake, naye kadaha ukwona keli. Kuya kenuka, kabatitsighwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Na hayamalitse ukuja ngupfu tsake tsimuyila.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli kowapetela iwanu ako Damasko</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli tsakakala ghamatsuwa chidogho ne iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu ako Damasko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Baho kandusa kupeta mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela ka Yesu ka Imwana we Imulungu.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Iwanu wose iwamuhulike wakangawala, walonga, “Imunu yuno si yuyula bae iyawakomile iwanu iwamtamanile Yesu akula Yerusalemu? Ambe tsakatsa hano yawaghoghe iwanu awo kuya yawaghale kwe iwatambika wakulu!”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Lekeni Sauli kaghendelela kupata ingupfu na kuwakangawatsa Wayahudi iwokala Damasko kwa kulangusa ka Yesu iyo Kiristu.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Haghabitile ghamatsuwa mengi, Wayahudi tsawelaghana wamkome Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Lekeni Sauli tsakalongelighwa imbuli ayo. Chilo na misi tsawamlolesa hane imibani ya kwingilila mkaye ili wamkome. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Lekeni nechilo wanang'ina wake wamsola, wamuhulumsa mliseghe kubitila mne litundu ilikalile mne libanda lye ghumji.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kakuya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli hapfikile Yerusalemu, tsakabama yelunge ne iwanang'ina, lekeni wawo wang'ali wompfuka, kwaapfila ng'awatoghole bae ka naye tsakakala imwanang'ina. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Lekeni Balinaba kamsola Sauli kamghala kwe iwatumighwa. Kawalongela Sauli pfayamwonile Imtwatsa mne ghumwanza ghwake na Imtwatsa tsakalonga naye, na pfayapetile taghwa lya Yesu bila kupfuka akula Damasko. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Apfo Sauli kakala nawo na ukwanga Yerusalemu yose aku kopeta imbuli ye Imtwatsa bila kupfuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Kalonga nawo na kwighutsa na Wayahudi iwolonga Chigiriki, lekeni nawo wabama kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ndughu hawamanyile imbuli ayo wamsola Sauli mbaka Kaisariya, wamghala Taso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Apfo iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu tsawakala tseghamba mne isi ya Yudeya na Galilaya na Samariya, waghumighwa ghumoyo na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka na wongetseka na kukala kwa kumpfuka Imtwatsa.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eneya kohonetsighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petiri hayang'ali yobita chila hanu, kawangila iwanu we Imulungu iwokala Luda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ako kampfika imunu yumwe iyakemighwe Eneya, yawasile mlusatsi kwa miyaka kumi na minane kwa utamu wa kuholola. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petiri kamlongela, “Eneya, Yesu Kiristu kokuhonetsa. Winuke, utandike lusatsi lwako.” Bahala Eneya kenuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Iwanu wose iwokala Luda na Sharoni wamwona Eneya, nawo wamuyila Imtwatsa.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dorika kohonetsighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ako Yopa tsakukala ne imwanang'ina yumwe pinga iyakemighwe Tabita kwa Chigiriki Dorika, mana yake mbawala. Ipinga ayo tsayang'ali yotenda ghanoghile matsuwa ghose na kuwapfila iwahingwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Mna matsuwa agho kaghula, kafa, waghwopfugha lukuli wake na waghwika mchiheleto cha kuchanya. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Luda si hatali ng'ani na Yopa, apfo iwanang'ina hawahulike Petiri ka ako, wawatuma iwanu weli kuna yeye, na wamlomba, “Utse kuna twetwe sambi baha.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Petiri kaghenda nawo, na hayapfikile, wamghala mchiheleto cha uchanya. Ipfitsuka wose wamtsunguluka Petiri aku wolila na kumlangusa maghwanda na maghwanda ghayatendile Dorika hayang'ali mghima. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petiri kawalapfa wose kunze, kuya katowa ghamaghoti, kalomba. Kamhundukila ipinga yula iyafile, kalonga, “Tabita, winuke.” Naye kafumbula tsinenge na hayamwonile Petiri, kenuka kakala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petiri kamkinda ghumoko kamwapfila ukwimwinula. Kuya kawakema iwanu we Imulungu na wala ipfitsuka, kamleka mghamoko mwawo ka mghima. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Imbuli ayo imanyika mne isi yose ya Yopa, na iwanu wengi wamtoghola Imtwatsa. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petiri kakala ako Yopa matsuwa mengi, tsakakala ne imunu iyotenda tsingotsi yakemighwe Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petiri na Korineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Ako Kaisariya tsakukala ne imunu yumwe taghwa lyake Korineli, chilongotsi wa chikosi chimwe cha asikali kumi ichikemighwe “Chikosi cha Italiya.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Yeye ne iwanu wa ukaye yake tsawang'ali wompfuka Imulungu. Tsaang'ali yowapfila wahingwa na komlomba Imulungu matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Litsuwa limwe saa tisa nemisi kona ghamaono mwatsimwatsi, malaika we Imulungu kamtsila, kalonga, “Korineli!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Korineli kamtsodolela tsinenge kwa kupfuka, kaghutsa, “Kuna choni Imtwatsa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Malaika ayo kedika, “Imulungu kahulika ukulomba kwako na sadaka tsako kwa iwahingwa, kuya ng'atsotsisemwa bae. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Sambi watume iwanu ako Yopa wakamkeme imunu iyokemighwa Simoni, taghwa lyake lingi Petiri. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Kokala mne ing'anda ya Simoni mtenda tsingotsi, ing'anda yake yahabehi ne ibahali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Malaika yula iyalongile naye hayokile, Korineli kawakema iwatumwa wake weli hamwe na asikali wake yumwe iyompfuka Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Kawalongela ghose ighalawile, kuya kawatuma Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kakona ghamaono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Litsuwa liwinzile, saa sita nemisi iwanu wala hawang'ali wamne ghumwanza, habehi na kupfika Yopa, Petiri kadina mchiswili ili yalombe. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Inzala imtama, kabama ichijo yaje, na ichijo haching'ali chikwambikighwa, kona ghamaono. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Kona kulanga kughubulighwa ne ichinu ka gholole kulu lyohulumsighwa muisi kwa membe tsake nne. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mghati mwake mna wanyama wose iwali na ghamaghulu mane, na iwotambala hasi na wapfideghe wa kulanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Kuya kahulika litsi lyomlongela, “Petiri, winuke uchinje uje!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Petiri kalonga, “Mbe, Imtwatsa, sina ndiye bae chinu chochose ichighomighwe au ichihile.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Litsi limlongela keli, “Uleke kupfikema pfiha ipfinu ipfideghetighwe ne Imulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Imbuli ayo ilawila mala ndatu, kuya gholole liyutsighwa kulanga.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petiri hayang'ali yokangawala ghamaono ghala gholonga choni, iwanu wala iwatumighwe na Korineli wapfika kune ing'anda ya Simoni, wema mlibani. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Wakemelela, waghutsa ka Simoni yokemighwa Petiri kokala hamo.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Simoni Petiri hayang'ali yokangawala ghamaono agho, baho Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kamlongela, “Simoni, hano hana iwanu wadatu wokubama ghweghwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Apfo winuke uhulumke ughende nawo, uleke kupfuka, kwaapfila yaniwatumile nene.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Petiri kahulumka hasi, kawalongela iwanu awo, “Nene iyo yamumbama. Mtsilile choni hano?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Wamwidika, “Twolawa kwa Korineli, imkulu we asikali, imunu yanoghile, mpfuka Imulungu na youlikitsighwa na Wayahudi wose. Malaika mwenzeluka kamlongela yakukeme ghweghwe ukaye yake ili yahulike chochose chautsomlongela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Kuya Petiri kawalongela iwanu awo wengile mng'anda, wawe wahenza wake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Litsuwa lya kabili Petiri kandusa ukuka nawo, ne iwanu wangi wa Yopa iwamtoghole Yesu waghenda naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Litsuwa liwinzile Petiri kapfika Kaisariya. Korineli tsaang'ali yowabeta hamwe na iwandughu tsake na sale tsake iyawakemile. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petiri hayang'ali yakwingila mng'anda, Korineli kaghenda kumbokela, kamtowela ghamaghoti, kenama mbaka hasi ghendo. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Lekeni Petiri kamwinula, kalonga, “Winuke, nene imwenyegho na imunu ka ghweghwe.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Na hang'ali yolonga naye, Petiri kengila mng'anda, kawapfika iwanu wengi wetingana. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwomanya ka Myahudi kaghomighwa na malaghitso ghe dini yake kukala ne imunu wa isi ingi, au kumwangila. Lekeni Imulungu kanilangusa ndeke kumwona imunu wowose ng'adeghete au keha. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Apfo hamnikemile, silemile bae kutsa. Lelo nowaghutsa, mnikemile choni?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Korineli kedika, “Matsuwa madatu ghabitile saa ka ino, tsanikala mng'anda mwangu nolomba. Bahala imunu yane maghwanda matselu ng'ani tsakema hambele hangu, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />kalonga, ‘Korineli, Imulungu kabokela malombi ghako na ng'aghasemwile aghala ghauweng'ile iwahingwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Lelo, watume iwanu waghende Yopa kumkema Simoni yokemighwa Petiri, kokala mne ing'anda ya Simoni mtenda tsingotsi, iyokala habehi ne ibahali.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Apfo bahala niwatuma iwanu kuna ghweghwe, naghwe kutenda ghoya ukutsa. Sambi twetwe twa hambele he Imulungu, kuhulikitsa chochose Imulungu chayakulaghitse kutulongela.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kowapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Kuya Petiri kandusa ukulonga, “Lelo nomanya ka Imulungu ng'obaghula bae, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />ila kowatoghola iwanu iwompfuka na kutenda ghanoghile kulawa chila isi. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Mwemwe mwomanya imbuli yaitumile Imulungu kuna iwanu wa Isiraeli, kalonga imbuli inoghile iitenda iwanu wakale tseghamba kubitila Yesu Kiristu, Imtwatsa wa wose. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mwemwe mwomanya ichilawile mne isi yose ya Yudeya, kwandusila Galilaya haumalile ubatitso yaupetile Yohane, <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Imulungu pfayamsaghule Yesu wa Natsareti kwa kumwing'a Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka ne ingupfu, na pfayaghendile chila hanu aku kotenda ghanoghile na kuhonetsa iwanu wose iwonelighwe na Setani, kwaapfila Imulungu tsakakala naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Twetwe twa iwakalangama we ipfinu pfose pfatendile mne isi ya Wayahudi na Yerusalemu. Tsawamkoma kwa kumuwamba mna msalaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Lekeni Imulungu kamtsilihula mne litsuwa lya kadatu, kuya kamtenda yoneke ne iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ng'oneke ne iwanu wose, ila na iwakalangama iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu, twetwe iyatujile na ukunwa naye hayatsilihuke. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Katulaghitsa tuwapetele iwanu na kuwalongela ka Yesu iyo iyasaghulighwe ne Imulungu yawe imlamutsi we iwaghima na iwafile. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Wanabii wose we Imulungu tsawalonga mbuli tsake ka chila imunu iyomtoghola katsoleghusighwa nzambi tsake kwa taghwa lyake.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu iwali si Wayahudi wobokela Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petiri hayang'ali yolonga mbuli atso, Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kawahulumkila wose iwang'ali wotegheletsa mbuli atso. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Awala Wayahudi iwatoghole iwatsile na Petiri wakangawala kwaapfila nzawadi ya Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka pfipfila ighumighwa kwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Kwaapfila wawahulika wolonga kwa lugha ingi, na kumtunya Imulungu. Kuya Petiri kalonga, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Iwanu wano wambokela Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka ka twetwe pfatumbokele. Angu nani lelo iyodaha kuwaghoma iwanu wano waleke kubatitsighwa kwa ghamatsi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Apfo kalaghitsa wabatitsighwe kwa taghwa lya Yesu Kiristu. Kuya wamlomba Petiri akale nawo kwa ghamatsuwa chidogho.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Petiri kowapetela Wayahudi mbuli tsa Korineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Kuya iwatumighwa ne iwamtoghole Yesu akula Yudeya wahulika ka iwanu iwali si Wayahudi nawo waibokela imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Apfo Petiri hayoile Yerusalemu, Wayahudi iwamtoghole Yesu wamlonga, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />walonga, “Ghweghwe kughenda mne tsing'anda tse iwanu ing'awengile ngoma bae na ukuja nawo.” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Petiri kandusa kuwalongela lughalugha chila ichinu pfachilawile.<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Tsanikala mne isi ya Yopa nolomba, baho mbona ghamaono, mbona ichinu ka gholole kulu lyohulumsighwa hasi kulawa kulanga kwa membe tsake nne, kuya litsa bahala hanikalile. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nilola mghati, mbona iwanyama wane ghamaghulu mane iwali muisi, iwanyama wa kubagho, iwotambala, ne iwapfideghe wa kulanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Kuya nihulika litsi lyonilongela, ‘Petiri, winuke uchinje uje.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nyidika, ‘Bae, Imtwatsa! Kuduhu ichinu chochose chihile au ichighomighwe ichingile mumlomo mwangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Litsi lilonga keli kulawa kulanga, ‘Uleke kuchikema chiha ichinu chayadeghete Imulungu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Imbuli ayo tsailawila mala ndatu, kuya ligholole liyutsighwa keli kulanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Baho iwanu wadatu iwatumighwe kuna nene kulawa Kaisariya wapfika mne ing'anda yaning'ali nikala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kanongela ndeke kupfuka, ng'ende nawo. Iwandughu wano sita pfipfila waghenda na nene, twingila mng'anda mwa Korineli. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Katulongela pfamwonile malaika yemile mng'anda mwake iyamlongele, ‘Utume iwanu isi ya Yopa wamkeme Simoni iyokemighwa Petiri. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Katsomghalilani imbuli iitsokukombola ghweghwe ne iwanu wose iwali mng'anda mwako.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Hanyanduse ukulonga, Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kawahulumkila ka pfayatuhulumkile twetwe aho mwanduso. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Baho ng'umbuka chayalongile Imtwatsa. ‘Yohane tsakabatitsa kwa ghamatsi, lekeni mwemwe mtsobatitsa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Apfo ka Imulungu kaweng'a iwanu iwali si Wayahudi nzawadi iila iyatwing'ile twetwe yatumtoghola Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu, lelo nene nani nimpinge Imulungu?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Hawahulike apfo, wenyamala. Wamtunya Imulungu, walonga, “Lelo, Imulungu kaweng'a iwanu iwali si Wayahudi toba iighala ughima.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanisa lya Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Kwa maghayo ighalawile Stefani hayakomighwe, iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu tsawapwililika. Wangi waghenda mbaka Foinike, Kupulo na Antiyokiya wapeta imbuli ila kwa Wayahudi waliyeka. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Wangi iwalawile Kupulo na Kirene waghenda Antiyokiya, pfipfila wandusa kulonga ne iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae, wawapetela imbuli inoghile ye Imtwatsa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Ngupfu ye Imtwatsa tsaikala nawo, na iwanu wengi watoghola na kumuyila Imtwatsa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Mbuli atso tsihulikighwa na iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu wa Yerusalemu, nawo wamtuma Balinaba aghende Antiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Naye hapfikile na kuwona uluso we Imulungu kwe iwanu wala, kadeng'elela na kawalomba waghendelele kumtoghola Imtwatsa kwa mimoyo yawo yose. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Balinaba tsakakala imunu yanoghile na yamemile Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka na iyotoghola ghendo, na iwanu wengi tsawongetseka kwe Imtwatsa.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Kuya Balinaba kaghenda Taso kumbama Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Hamwonile, kamghala Antiyokiya. Nawo wose weli kwa ghumwaka mghima tsawetingana na iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu na kuwalangulitsa iwanu wengi. Iwanang'ina tsawandusa ukukemighwa Wakiristu ako Antiyokiya.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ghamatsuwa ghaghala manabii wangi we Imulungu iwalawile Yerusalemu wapfika Antiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Yumwe wao iyakemighwe Agabo kema, na kwa uwetso wa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kalonga ka itsolawila inzala ng'ulu muisi mwose. Na inzala ayo ilawila mne ghamatsuwa gha mndewa Kilaudi. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Wakiristu wala walamula chila imunu ka pfayodaha aghale chochose ili kuwapfila iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu iwokala Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Tsawatenda apfo, wawatuma Balinaba na Sauli wawaghalile iwabala we iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Yakobu kokomighwa na Petiri naye kakohighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Ghamatsuwa ghaghala mndewa Herodi kawaghogha iwanu wangi iwomtoghola Kiristu na kuwadununza. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Kamkoma kwa limaghe Jakobu ndughu yake Yohane. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Honile Wayahudi wanoghelesighwa na achila chayatendile, kaghendelela, kamghogha Petiri. Agha ghatendeka mne chihungo che ghamatsuwa ghe Pfighate ipfilihela hamila. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Hamghoghile, kamwika mchifungo, mne ghamoko gha makingili mane gha asikali wane wane, wamlolese. Herodi tsakabama Pasaka ing'amala amlapfe hambele he iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Petiri hayang'ali mchifungo, iwamtoghole Yesu wamlombela kwe Imulungu kwa ghumoyo.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaika we Imtwatsa komlapfa Petiri mchifungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Chilo chila Herodi ng'ana yamlapfe kunze hambele he iwanu, Petiri tsakawasa haghati ghati ha asikali weli, kohighwa minyororo mili, ne iwakalitsi tsawang'ali wololesa libani lya chifungo. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Bahala, malaika we Imtwatsa kalawila na ghumwanga ghumulika mne chiheleto chila. Malaika ayo kamtowa Petiri mlubapfu, kamlamsa. Kalonga, “Hima, winuke.” Bahala minyororo imwohile ghamoko ilaghala hasi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Kuya malaika ayo kamlongela, “Pfala msipi ghwako na pfilatu pfako.” Petiri katenda apfo. Kuya kamlongela, “Pfala ghwanda lyako uniwinze.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petiri kamkoleletsa kunze mwa gheletsa, lekeni ng'amanyile bae ighatendighwe ne malaika we Imulungu ghang'ali gholawila kweli, ila kapfikitsa kakona ghamaono. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Wabita chituwo cha wakalitsi cha mwanduso na cha keli, kuya wapfika mne libani lye chuma ililongosa mne ghumji. Libani liwapfughukila lyenyegho, nawo walawa kunze. Hawang'ali woghenda mne inzila imwe, bahala malaika ayo kamleka Petiri.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Petiri hayatangile ichimlawile, kalonga, “Sambi nomanya ghendo ka Imtwatsa kamtuma malaika wake yandapfe mne ghamoko gha Herodi na kulawa mna chila chinu chawalolele Wayahudi.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Hayatangile apfo, kaghenda kune ing'anda ya Mariya, mai wake Yohane, taghwa lyake lya keli Maliki ne iwanu wengi tsawetingana amo wolomba. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petiri hayagong'onde libani lya kunze, imtumwa yumwe ipinga, taghwa lyake Roda katsa kuhulikitsa. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Naye hayamanyile litsi lya Petiri, kadeng'elela ng'ani mbaka kaleka kupfughula libani katsumila mng'anda, kawalongela, “Petiri kema kunze halibani.” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Wamlongela, “Kuna lukwale.” Lekeni yeye kakomangitsa ka pfipfo pfaili. Walonga, “Ayo malaika wake.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Petiri kaghendelela kughong'onda libani, na hawapfughule hawamwone yeye, wakangawala. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Petiri kawapungila ghumoko wenyamale, kawalongela Imtwatsa pfayamlapfile mne ligheletsa. Kuya kawalongela wakamlongele Jakobu imbuli ayo, na awala wangi iwamtoghole Yesu, kuya yeye kaghenda hanu hangi.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Nemitondo haipfikile, asikali tsawapfuka ghendo kwa achila ichimlawile Petiri. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Kuya Herodi kalaghitsa wambame Petiri, lekeni ng'awamwonile bae. Kawaghutsa iwakalitsi wala, kuya kalaghitsa wakomighwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Kuya Herodi kalawa Yudeya kaghenda Kaisariya, kakala ako matsuwa chidogho.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Naye Herodi tsakawonela maya iwanu wa Tiro na Sidoni. Apfo iwanu awo wamghendela hamwe. Hawamalitse kumtenda Balasto yawe sale yawo, imunu iyatogholighwe sideke ne imndewa. Walomba Herodi wakale nae tseghamba, kwaapfila isi tsawo tsatsing'ali tsihemela ichijo kulawa mne isi ye imndewa.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Litsuwa limwe ilisaghulighwe, Herodi kapfala maghwanda ghake gha chindewa, kakala mne chighoda chake che undewa, kalonga ne iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Iwanu wakemelela, “Alino litsi lya yumwe we milungu, si litsi lye imunu bae!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Bahala malaika we Imtwatsa kamghwisa hasi Herodi, kwaapfila ng'amwing'ile bae Imulungu utunitso, kakindighwa na sango, kafa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Imbuli ye Imulungu ighendelela kukula na ukwenela.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Balinaba na Sauli hawamalitse ing'onde ye Imulungu, woya kulawa Yerusalemu, wamsola na Yohane, iyakemighwe Maliki.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Saulo wosaghulighwa na kutumighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mna awala iwamtoghole Yesu ako Antiyokiya tsakukala na manabii we Imulungu ne iwalangulitsi, nawo tsawakala Balinaba na Simoni iyakemighwe Mtitu na Lukiyo iyolawila Kirene na Sauli na Manaeni iyalelighwe hamwe na Herodi. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Hawang'ali womtamanila Imulungu na kufunga kuja, Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kalonga, “Nibaghulileni Balinaba na Sauli, wasang'ane ing'onde yaniwakemele.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Kuya hawamalitse kufunga ukuja na ukulomba, wawekila ghamoko wawaleka waghende.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli na Balinaba ako Kupulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Kuya Balinaba na Sauli aku waghalighwa na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, wahulumkila Seleukiya, na kulawa ako wadina mnumbwi mbaka Kupulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Hawapfikile ghumji ghwa Salami, wapeta imbuli ye Imulungu mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela tse Wayahudi, Yohane Maliki tsayang'ali yowapfila mne sang'ano ayo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Tsawanga mne chisiwa chose mbaka wapfika Pafo, ako wampfika Myahudi yumwe mhawi na nabii wa ughutsu iyakemighwe Bariyesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Imunu ayu tsakakala sale wa Serigiyo Pauli, imkulu we isi, imunu yane tsimbutsi ng'ani. Serigiyo Pauli tsakawakema Balinaba na Sauli waghende kuna yeye, tsakabama yahulike imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Lekeni ayo mhawi Elima, kwaapfila ayo mana ya taghwa lyake tsakahisanya nawo, kabama amtende imkulu yula we ichisiwa aleke kutoghola Ukiristu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Lekeni Sauli, pfipfila iyakemighwe Pauli, aku kamema Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, kamtsodolela tsinenge Elima, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />kalonga, “Ghweghwe kwa imwana wa Setani! Ghweghwe kwa mwihile wa chila chinu chinoghile! Kumema ughutsu na ung'enye wose. Ghamatsuwa ghose ng'uleka bae kutsihinya nzila itsigholoke tse Imtwatsa! <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Lelo ghumoko ghwe Imtwatsa ghutsokuhigha, naghwe kutsakuwa chimbughumbughu, ng'utsakwona bae litsua kwa ichipindi chino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Bahala ukungu ne ichisi pfimtsila mnenge, kaghenda kuno na kuno, kabama imunu wa kumkinda ghumoko yamlongotse. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Ayula imkulu we ichisiwa haghonile ighalawile, kamtoghola Yesu, kakangawala kwa malangulitso ghe Imtwatsa<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Pauli ako Antiyokiya Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Kuya Pauli na weyaghe wadina mnumbwi kulawa Pafo wapfika Periga, ghumji ighuli Pamfiliya, baho Yohane Maliki kawaleka, koya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Lekeni wawo waghendelela na ghumwanza kulawa Periga mbaka Antiyokiya ako Pisidiya. Litsuwa lya Sabato wengila mne ing'anda ye ukulombela, wakala hasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ichitabu cha malaghitso gha Musa ne ichitabu cha manabii we Imulungu hapfisomighwe, iwakulu we ing'anda ya ukulombela watuma imbuli kwa tsina Pauli, wawalongela, “Wandughu, ka mna imbuli yo ukuwalongela iwanu wano, walongeleni.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Pauli kenuka, kawapungila ghumoko kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Mwemwe Waisiraeli weyangu, na mwemwe iwanu wangi yamumpfuka Imulungu mnitegheletse! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Imulungu we iwanu wano wa Isiraeli tsakawasaghula aba tsetu, kawabaliki iwanu awo hala hawang'ali wahenza mne isi ya Misiri, kuya kwa uwetso wake mkulu kawalapfa mne isi ayo. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Kwa miyaka ka alubaini kawadudumila akula kunyika. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Naye tsakaghahinya makabila saba mne isi ya Kanani, na kuweng'a iwanu wake isi ila iwe yawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Agha ghose ghakala kwa miyaka miya nne hamsini.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Hambele, Imulungu kaweng'a walamutsi iwanu wake mbaka mne matsuwa gha Samweli, nabii we Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Kuya iwanu walomba wawe ne imndewa, Imulungu kaweng'a Sauli, imwana wa Kishi wa kabila lya Benjamini yawe mndewa wawo kwa chipindi cha miyaka alubaini. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Imulungu hamlapfile Sauli, kamsaghula Daudi yawe mndewa wawo. Imulungu kamlonga pfino Daudi, ‘Nimwona Daudi imwana wa Yese, ka imunu yaghunoghele ghumoyo ghwangu. Yeye katsotenda aghala ghose ghanibama yaghatende.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kulawa mne lukolo lwa Daudi, Imulungu kawaghalila iwanu wa Isiraeli Mkombotsi Yesu, ka pfalongile. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Hala Yesu ng'ana yanduse isang'ano yake, Yohane tsakawapetela iwanu wose wa Isiraeli watsileke nzambi na wabatitsighwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Naye Yohane hang'ali yomalitsa isang'ano yake, kalonga, ‘Mwemwe mwolonga nene mkombotsi? Nene si yula bae yamumbeta. Ila ayo kakutsa kuchughu kwangu na nene sibamighwa bae kudohola imitsabi ye imikwabatsa yake.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Ndughu tsangu, watsukulu wa Abrahamu, namwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi yamumpfuka Imulungu, imbuli ino ya ukombotsi ighalighwa kuna twetwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Iwanu wa Yerusalemu na iwakulu wawo ng'awamtangile bae Yesu ka iyo imkombotsi, apfo watimilitsa mbuli tse manabii we Imulungu itsisomighwa chila litsuwa lya Sabato kwa kumuwamba mna msalaba. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Hata ka ng'awonile bae imbuli iimtenda yakomighwe, wamlomba Pilato yamuhighe yamkome. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Hawamalitse kughatenda ghose ghandikilighwe yeye mne Ghamaandiko, wamhulumsa kulawa mna msalaba, wamwika mne likabuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Lekeni Imulungu kamtsilihula, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />na kwa ghamatsuwa mengi ang'ali yakoneka na awala iwang'ali wakwanga naye kulawa Galilaya kughenda Yerusalemu. Hawo sambi wa iwakalangama wake kwa iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Na twetwe twompetelani mwemwe imbuli inoghile, mbuli ila Imulungu yelaghane ne iwabala wetu. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Kaitimilitsa kuna twetwe watsukulu wawo kwa kumtsilihula Yesu ka pfayandikighwe mne Tsaburi ya kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">“Ghweghwe kwa imwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">leloli niwa Aba wako.”<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Kuya mne imbuli ya ukumtsilihula aleke kwola, Imulungu kalonga apfi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">“Nitsomwing'ani mwemwe tsibalaka tsa kweli itsideghete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">tsanilaghane na Daudi.”<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Na hanu hangi mne Tsaburi holonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">“Ng'utsomleka bae Mwenzeluka wako yole.”<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Lekeni kwa Daudi ng'aiwile apfo bae, kwaapfila Daudi tsakamalitsa kumtumikila Imulungu mne ughima wake, kuya kafa, katsikighwa hamwe na aba tsake na lukuli lwake lwola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Lekeni ayula iyatsilihulighwe ne Imulungu, ng'olile bae.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />“Apfo wandughu tsangu nobama mmanye ka kubitila Yesu, imbuli ya kuleghusighwa nzambi yopetighwa kuna mwemwe, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />na chila imunu iyomtoghola Yesu koleghusighwa nzambi tsake, chinu ing'achidahika bae kwa ghamalaghitso gha Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Mwalangitse lelo ileke kuwalawila imbuli yawalongile manabii we Imulungu, <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Mtegheletse mwemwe imbetsa, mkangawale mwaghe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Kwaapfila nene nitsotenda ichinu mne ghamatsuwa ghenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">ichinu yang'amtsochitoghola ghendo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">hata imunu ang'awalongela!’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Pauli na Balinaba hawang'ali wolawa mne ing'anda ya ukulombela, iwanu wawalomba watse walonge ipfinu pfino mne litsuwa lya Sabato ilikutsa. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Mtingano haghumalile, Wayahudi wengi ne iwanu wengi iwali si Wayahudi bae iwompfuka Imulungu wawawinza. Pauli na Balinaba walomba nawo, wawaghela ghumoyo waghendelele mne uluso we Imulungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Mne litsuwa lya Sabato liwinzile, iwanu wa ghumji ghose wetingana kuhulikitsa imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Lekeni Wayahudi hawonile mtingano aghwo, wona chepfu, wabela aghala ghayang'ali yolonga Pauli, kuya wamligha. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Lekeni Pauli na Balinaba wawedika bila kupfuka, “Tsatubamighwa tanu tuwalongele mwemwe imbuli ye Imulungu, lekeni kwaapfila mwoilema na kwibona ka ng'ambamighwa bae kuwa na ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. Lelo twowaghendela iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kwaapfila Imtwatsa tsakatulaghitsa apfi, ‘Nikwika uwe ghumwanga kwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae, uwaghalile ukombotsi mbaka utsighilo we isi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae hawahulike apfo, wadeng'elela na waitunya imbuli ye Imtwatsa, na wose iwasaghulighwe kwa ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose watoghola.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Imbuli ye Imtwatsa yenela mne isi yose ila. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Lekeni Wayahudi wawasongesa iwapinga iwohulikitsighwa, iwampfukile Imulungu, ne iwakulu we isi ila. Wandusa kuwadununza Pauli na Balinaba, kuya wawawinga mna isi yawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Nawo iwatumighwa wawakung'usila timbwisi lya ghamaghulu ghawo, kuya waghenda mne isi ya Ikoniya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Na iwanang'ina tsawadeng'elela na wamema Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ako Ikoniya Pauli na Balinaba tsawaghenda mne ing'anda ya ukulombela ya Wayahudi ka pfawaghendagha. Na kwaapfila pfawalongile, Wayahudi ne iwanu iwali si Wayahudi wengi wamtoghola Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Lekeni Wayahudi ing'awotoghola wawasongesa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae wawahile iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Pauli na Balinaba waghendelela kukala ako matsuwa mengi, walonga mbuli tse Imtwatsa bila kupfuka, iyalanguse usenga wa uluso wake ka wa kweli kwa kuweng'a uwetso wa kutenda pfihulo ne ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Iwanu wa isi ila tsaweghola, wangi wawawinza Wayahudi na wangi wawawinza iwatumighwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Kuya iwanu iwali si Wayahudi na Wayahudi ne iwakulu wawo walamla wawatendele pfihile iwatumighwa awo, na wawatowe ne ghamabwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Lekeni iwatumighwa hawahulike imbuli ayo watsumila Lisitira na Deribe, isi ya Likaniya na mne isi itsili habehi, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />ako waghendelela kupeta Imbuli Inoghile.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Balinaba ako Lisitira na Deribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Ako Lisitira tsakukala ne imunu yaholole ghamaghulu, tsakakala chimbete kulawa kwelekighwa kwake na ng'aghendile bae. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Imunu ayo kamhulikitsa Pauli hayang'ali yolonga, na Pauli hayamtsodolele tsinenge, kamwona imunu ayo kotoghola ka kodaha kuhonetsighwa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />kakemelela, “Wime wima kwa ghamaghulu ghako!” Bahala imunu ayo kadaluka, kandusa kughenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Na mtingano hawonile chatendile Pauli wakemelela kwa Chilukoniya, “Milungu iwa ka wanu, nayo ituhulumkila twetwe.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Wamwing'a taghwa Balinaba Seyu, na Pauli wamkema Heme kwaapfila yeye tsakakala mlonga mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Mlapfa inambiko wa Seyu, ing'anda yake ye ukulombela iikalile aho kunze kwe ghumji, kaghala ng'ombe na maluwa mna imibani ya ghumji kwaapfila yeye na mtingano ghula ghwe iwanu tsawabama wawalapfile nambiko iwatumighwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Lekeni Pauli na Balinaba hawahulike apfi, waghadegha maghwanda ghawo, watsumila mne mtingano ghwe iwanu, wakemelela. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Amweye, ebali mwotenda apfi? Twetwe pfipfila twa iwanu ka mwemwe. Twowaghalila Imbuli Inoghile ili mpfileke ipfinyagho, na mumuhindukile Imulungu yane ughima, iyalumbile kulanga ne isi ne ibahali ne ipfinu pfose ipfili mumo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ghumwande, tsakawaleka iwanu wose watende ka pfawobama. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Lekeni ng'alekile bae kwilangusa kwa kuwatendela ghanoghile, kaweng'a imvula kulawa kulanga na ghamapfuno kwa imisimu, kawagholela ipfijo pfingi na kuwamemesa deng'elelo mne mimoyo yenu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Hata ka tsawalonga apfo, ikala pfikomu kuwaghoma waleke kuwatambikila.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Lekeni Wayahudi wamwenga iwalawile Antiyokiya ne Ikoniya tsawatsa, wawatenda iwanu wawe chinu chimwe nawo. Wamtowa Pauli ne ghamabwe, wamkwegha mbaka kunze kwe ghumji, tsawapfikitsa kafa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Lekeni iwanang'ina hawamtsunguluke, Pauli kenuka koya ukaye. Litsuwa liwinzile yeye na Balinaba waghenda Deribe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Balinaba wakuya Antiyokiya mne isi ya Siriya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Tsawapeta Imbuli Inoghile mne isi ayo na iwanu wengi wamtoghola Yesu. Kuya woya Lisitira na Ikoniya na Antiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wawaghuma ghumoyo iwanang'ina, wawalomba wakale mne ukutoghola kula. Wawalongela, “Twobamighwa tubitile mne maghayo mengi ukwingila mne undewa we Imulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Pauli na Balinaba hawamalitse kuwasaghula iwakulu mna chila kingili lye iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu, walomba na wafunga ukuja, kuya waweka mna ghamoko ghe Imtwatsa iwamtoghole.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Kuya Pauli na Balinaba woka Pamfiliya kubitila Pisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Hawamalitse kupeta imbuli ako Periga, wahulumka mbaka Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kulawa Ataliya, wadina mne mnumbwi, woya Antiyokiya, hanu hala hawawalombele iwanu uluso we Imulungu kwa isang'ano ila yawaitimitse.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Hawapfikile hala, tsawetingana na iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu, wawalongela ipfinu pfose pfayatendile Imulungu hamwe nawo, na pfayawapfughulile libani lye ukutoghola iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Na wakala ako kwa matsuwa mengi, hamwe ne iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mtingano ako Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Tsakukala ne wanu iwalawile Yudeya wapfika Antokiya, na wandusa kuwalangulitsa iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu, wawalongela, “Ka ng'amkwingila ngoma ka pfalaghitse Musa ng'amdaha kukombolighwa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Imbuli ino iwatenda Pauli na Balinaba wesonge nawo. Apfo Pauli na Balinaba wasaghulighwa hamwe ne iwanu wangi wa Antiyokiya iwamtoghole Yesu waghende Yerusalemu kuwona iwatumighwa ne iwabala kwaajili ye imbuli ayo.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Tsawaghalighwa na Wakiristu, na hawang'ali woghenda wabitila Foinike na Samariya, wawalongela iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae pfawamtoghole Imulungu. Imbuli ino iwadeng'elesa ng'ani iwanu wose iwamtoghole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Hawapfikile Yerusalemu wabokelighwa na iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu ne iwatumighwa ne iwabala, nawo wawalongela ipfinu pfose Imulungu pfayatendile kubitila wawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Lekeni iwanu wangi iwamtoghole Yesu kulawa kingili lya Mafarisayo wema, walonga, “Yobamighwa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae wengile ngoma na waghakinde malaghitso gha Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Iwatumighwa ne iwabala wetingana ili walangule imbuli ayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Hawamalitse mdawalo, Petiri kenuka, kawalongela, “Ndughu tsangu, mwomanya ka ghumwande Imulungu tsakanisaghula kulawa mna mwemwe niwapetele Imbuli Inoghile iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae, wahulike na kuitoghola. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Imulungu iyomanya imimoyo ye iwanu kalangusa ka kawatoghola kwa kuweng'a Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, ka pfayatendile kuna twetwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ng'atendile bae ubaghutsi wowose kuna twetwe na kuna wawo, kaideghetesa imimoyo yawo kwa ukutoghola. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Lelo ebali, mwomghetsa Imulungu kwa kuwatwika imtsigho mtito iwamtoghole Yesu, imtsigho yang'atudahile twetwe kuwinula wala iwabala wetu? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Lekeni twotoghola kuwa twokombolighwa kwa uluso we Imtwatsa Yesu, ka wawo pfawotoghola.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Apfo mtingano wose we iwanu tsaghunyamala wawategheletsa Balinaba na Pauli wowalongela pfihulo na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayatendile Imulungu kubitila wawo kwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Hawamalitse kulonga, Jakobu kalonga, “Ndughu tsangu mnitegheletse. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni tsakatulongela Imulungu pfayawatendele iwanu iwali si Wayahudi aho mwanduso, tsakawasaghula wangi wawo wawe iwanu wake. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Imbuli tse manabii we Imulungu tseghala ghendo ne imbuli ino, ka Ghamaandiko pfagholonga,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Imulungu kolonga, ‘Hambele he ipfinu pfino nitsakuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na nene nitsochitsenga keli chibumbulika cha Daudi ichighwile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Nitsotsenga mahame ghake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na kuchimitsa keli.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Ili iwanu iwasighale wambame Imtwatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">ne iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae wose yaniwakemile wawe wangu.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Apfi pfipfo pfayolonga Imtwatsa, iyatendile imbuli ino imanyike kulawa ghumwande.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakobu kaghendelela kulonga, “Lelo nene nolamla pfino, tuleke kuwadununza iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae iwamuhundukile Imulungu, <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />ila tuwandikile ibaluwa ya kuwalongela waleke ukuja ipfijo ipfihinyighwe kwa kutambikighwa kwe ipfinyagho, waleke utsinzi, waleke ukuja imnyama yabotighwe na waleke ukunwa idamu. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kwaapfila kulawa ghumwande Malaghitso gha Musa tsaghapetighwa chila kaye mne tsing'anda tse Imulungu chila litsuwa lya Sabato.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibaluwa kwa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae iwatoghole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Kuya iwatumighwa ne iwabala hamwe ne kingili lye iwanu wose iwomtoghola Kiristu walamla kuwasaghula iwanu mghati mwawo na kuwaghala Antiyokiya hamwe na Pauli na Balinaba. Apfo wawasaghula Yuda iyakemighwe Barisaba, na Sila. Awo tsawakala pfilongotsi we iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Waweng'a ibaluwa ino,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">“Twetwe iwatumighwa ne iwabala ne iwandughu tsenu twowalamsani mwemwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae imumtoghola Imulungu yamli ako Antiyokiya, Siriya na Kilikiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Kwaapfila tuhulika ka iwanu wangi iwalawile kuna twetwe wawahanganya na waitsufa mimoyo yenu kwa chawalongile, lekeni ng'awatumighwe na twetwe bae. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Apfo twitingana hamwe, tulamla kusaghula iwanu na kuwaghala kuna mwemwe hamwe na sale tsetu tsina Balinaba na Pauli, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />iwanu iwalapfile ughima wawo kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Apfo twowatuma Yuda na Sila kuna mwemwe. Awo watsowalongela iwenyegho acho chatumwandikileni. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka katulangusa tuleke kuwatwika mtsigho kubita aghano ghambamighwa mghamanye, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />mleke ukuja ipfijo ipfitambikighwe kwe ipfinyagho, mleke ukunwa idamu, na mleke ukuja chibudu, na mleke utsinzi. Mtsotenda ghoya mng'aghaleka agho. Mkale tseghamba.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Iwanu awo walawa Yerusalemu wahulumkila Antiyokiya, baho wawakema iwanu wose iwomtoghola Kiristu, waweng'a ibaluwa ila. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Nawo hawamalitse kuisoma, mbuli tsake tsiwaghuma ghumoyo, tsawadeng'elela sideke. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Kuya Yuda na Sila kwaapfila wawo iwenyegho tsawakala manabii we Imulungu, walonga mengi kuwaghuma ghumoyo na kuwaghela ngupfu iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Na hawamalitse kukala ako, iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu wawalekela waghende tseghamba kwa awo iwawatumile. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Lekeni Sila kalamla kusighala.<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Pauli na Balinaba wakala ako Antiyokiya, ako walangulitsa na kupeta Imbuli ye Imtwatsa hamwe ne iwanu wamwenga wengi.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Barinaba weghola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Haghabitile matsuwa mengi, Pauli kamlongela Balinaba, “Leka tuye kuchughu tukawalole wayetu iwamtoghole Yesu mne kaye tsose tsatuwapetele imbuli ye Imtwatsa na kuwona pfawoghendelela.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Balinaba tsakabama yamsole Yohane iyakemighwe Maliki waghende naye. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Lekeni Pauli ng'abamile bae waghende na Maliki, kwaapfila tsakawaleka akula Pamfiliya na ng'aghendelele ne isang'ano hamwe nawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Kuya wesonga ng'ani mbaka weghola. Balinaba kamsola Maliki, wadina mne mnumbwi waghenda Kupulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Naye Pauli kamsaghula Sila, ne iwanu iwamtoghole Kiristu wa hanu hala hawamalitse kuwalombela uluso we Imtwatsa, woka. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Tsakabita Siriya na Kilikiya kughaghuma ghumoyo makanisa.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Pauli na Sila womsola Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pauli kapfika Deribe, kuya kapfika Lisitira. Baho tsakukala ne imunu yumwe iyomtoghola Yesu, taghwa lyake Timoteo. Mai wake tsakala Myahudi iyamtoghole Imtwatsa, lekeni aba wake tsakakala Mgiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoteo tsayang'ali yotogholighwa ne iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu iwakalile Lisitira na Ikoniya. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pauli tsakabama yelongotse naye, apfo kamwingitsa ngoma kwaajili ya Wayahudi iwakalile isi ila, kwaapfila wose tsawamanya aba wake kakala Mgiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Na hawang'ali wakwanga mne kaye tsila, waweng'a iwanu iwamtoghole Imtwatsa malaghitso ighalamlighwe ne iwatumighwa ne iwabala ako Yerusalemu na kuwalongela waghakinde. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Apfo makanisa ghongetseka mne ukutoghola, ne iwanu iwomtoghola Imtwatsa wang'ali wakongetseka chila litsuwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kakona ghamaono ako Tirowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Pauli na wayaghe waghenda mne isi ya Firigiya na Galatiya, kwaapfila waghomighwa na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka waleke kulonga imbuli ila mne isi ye Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Hawapfikile habehi na Misiya, tsawabama waghende Bisiniya, lekeni Ghumuhe ghwa Yesu kawaghoma. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Apfo wabita Misiya, wahulumkila Tirowa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Chilo chila Pauli tsakona ghamaono ghe imunu wa Makedoniya kema, komlomba, kalonga, “Loka utse Makedoniya utwapfile!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Pauli hayamalitse kwona ghamaono, baho twiyandaa tughende Makedoniya, kwaapfila twona ka Imulungu katukema kuwalongela Imbuli Inoghile.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Kulawa Tirowa, tudina mnumbwi mbaka Samotirake, litsuwa liwinzile tupfika Napoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kulawa ako tughenda Filipi, kaye ng'ulu mne isi ya Makedoniya, hane undewa wa Chirumi. Tukala ako kwa ghamatsuwa mengi. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Mne litsuwa lya Sabato tsatughenda kune ghumto kunze mwa libani lya ghumji, baho tsatupfikitsa kung'akalile na hanu he ukulombela. Tukala hasi, tulonga ne iwapinga iwatingane hanu hala. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Mna awala iwatutegheletse tsakukala ne ipinga yumwe iyompfuka Imulungu. Tsakakemighwa Lidiya, ipinga ayo kolawila mne ghumji ghwa Tiyatira. Yeye tsaang'ali youtsa maghwanda gha bei ng'ulu. Imulungu tsakapfughula ghumoyo ghwake kubokela aghala ghayalongile Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Hayamalitse kubatitsighwa yeye ne iwanu wa kaye yake, katulomba tughende ukaye yake, kalonga, “Ka mmbona nene nomtoghola Imtwatsa, mtse mkale ukaye yangu.” Katulomba ghendo tughende.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli na Sila wakwikighwa mchifungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Litsuwa limwe hatung'ali twoghenda hanu he ukulombela tutingana ne imtumwa yumwe mwali iyakalile ne ichinyamkela wa kulaghula. Mwali ayo tsayang'ali yowapatila sendi nyingi ng'ani iwatwatsa wake kwa ukulaghula kwake. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Mwali ayo tsakamkoleletsa Pauli na twetwe, aku kokemelela, “Iwanu wano wa iwatumighwa we Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani. Womlongelani pfamdaha ukukombolighwa!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Tsakatenda apfo chila litsuwa, mbaka Pauli tsakona maya, kamghalukila ichinyamkela yula kamlongela, “Nokulaghitsa kwa taghwa lya Yesu Kiristu, lawa kuna mwali yuno!” Bahala ichinyamkela kamlawa.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Iwatwatsa wake hawamanyile ka lolelo lyawo lya kupata sendi lyuka, wawaghogha Pauli na Sila, wawakwegha mbaka kuna ghulilo hambele he iwakulu we isi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Wawaghala kwe iwalamutsi, walonga, “Iwanu wano Wayahudi, nawo wotenda hengele muisi mwetu, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />kuya wolangulitsa mbuli tse ipfihendo ipfatughomighwe twetwe Waroma kupfibokela au kupfiwinza.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Iwanu wose welunga kuwatowa Pauli na Sila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Kuya iwalamutsi waghadegha maghwanda gha Pauli na Sila, walaghitsa watowighwe pfiboko. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Hawamalitse kuwatowa ng'ani, waweka mwigheletsa, wamlaghitsa mkalitsi wa chifungo yawalolese ghendo. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Naye hayabokele ghamalaghitso agho, kaweka mne ichiheleto cha mghati, kawoha ghamaghulu ghawo kwa libao.<figure style="fig" file="21 Feet in Stocks.jpg" size="col" ref="16:24">Pauli na Sila wohighwa ghamaghulu kwa libao</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Lekeni chilo chikulu Pauli na Sila tsawang'ali womlomba Imulungu na kumwimbila na ukumtunya, ne iwanu wangi iwohighwe wang'ali wowategheletsa. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Bahala tsaghulawila mdedemo mkulu ghwe iisi mbaka lukwambatsa lwa chifungo luhighisika. Baho imibani ipfughuka na tsimingu tsa chila imunu tsileghela. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mkalitsi yula wa ligheletsa kalamka, na honile imibani ya ligheletsa ipfughuka, kasola limaghe kabama yekome imwenyegho kwaapfila tsakapfikitsa iwohighwa watsuma. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Lekeni Pauli kakemelela, “Uleke kwilagha umwenyegho! Wose twabaha!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Imkalitsi ayo wa ligheletsa kalomba chitasa chighalighwe, katsumila mng'anda, keghwisa mmaghulu mwa Pauli na Sila aku kodedema. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Kuya kawalapfa kunze kawaghutsa, “Watwatsa wangu, nendetse ili ng'ombolighwe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Wamwidika, “Umtoghole Imtwatsa Yesu, naghwe kutsokombolighwa hamwe ne kaye yako.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Wampetela imbuli ye Imtwatsa, yeye ne iwanu wose iwali mkaye mwake. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ichilo chichila yula imkalitsi wa ligheletsa kawasola, kawopfugha ipfilonda pfawo, kuya yeye ne iwanu wa kaye yake wabatitsighwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Kawasola Pauli na Sila kawaghala ukaye yake, kawekila ichijo, naye na iwanu wa kaye yake yose wadeng'elela kwaapfila sambi tsawang'ali womtoghola Imulungu.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Lupfilipfili iwalamutsi wawatuma iwakulu we asikali kwe imkalitsi wa ligheletsa walonga, “Walekeni iwanu wala woke.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Ayula imkalitsi wa chifungo kamlongela Pauli. “Iwalamutsi walaghitsa ghweghwe na Sila mlekelighwe. Lelo mwodaha kuka, mghende tseghamba.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Lekeni Pauli kawalongela iwakulu we asikali, “Watutowa hambele he iwanu hata ka ng'atutendile totso, na twetwe twa Waroma, kuya watwika mwigheletsa. Lelo wobama watulapfe chinyelenyele. Bae! Leka watse watulapfe iwenyegho.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Iwakulu we asikali wawalongela iwalamutsi, na hawahulike kuwa Pauli na Sila tsawakala iwanu wa Roma, wapfuka. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Apfo watsa, wawalomba wawasamehe, kuya wawalapfa mne ligheletsa na kuwalomba walawe mne ghumji ghula. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Pauli na Sila hawalawile mchifungo waghenda mne ing'anda ya Lidiya, baho wetingana ne iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu, wawaghela ghumoyo. Kuya woka.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Ako Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pauli na Sila waghenda mbaka Tesalonike, wabitila Amfipoli na Apoloniya, ako tsakukala ne ing'anda ya ukulombela ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Pauli ka pfatsowele, kengila mne ing'anda ye ukulombela ne ukulonga nawo kwa matsuwa gha sabato madatu, kwa Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka kawalongela na <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />kuwalangusa ka ibamighwa Kiristu yadununzike na kutsilihuka. Pauli kalonga, “Ayu Yesu yaniwapetela mbuli tsake, iyo Kiristu Mkombotsi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wayahudi wangi watoghola na welunga na Pauli na Sila, pfipfila na Wagiriki iwampfukile Imulungu ne iwapinga wengi pfilongotsi watoghola.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Lekeni Wayahudi wona chepfu, wawasola iwanu wehile kulawa mne ghulilo, wandusa kutenda hengele mne kaye yose. Wengila mng'anda mwa Yasoni kuwabama tsina Pauli na Sila ili wawaghale kunze kune iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Lekeni ng'awawapfikile bae, apfo wamkwegha Yasoni ne iwanu wangi iwamtoghole Yesu mbaka kwe iwakulu wa ghumji, wakemelela, walonga, “Iwanu wano iwaihinyile iisi yose lelo watsa hano, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />na Yasoni kawabokela ukaye yake. Wawo wose wolema kutenda malaghitso gha Mkulu wa Roma, wolonga kuna imndewa yungi, taghwa lyake Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Iwakulu we isi ne iwanu hawahulike apfo tsawaghanzika. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Iwakulu awo wawatotsa faini Yasoni na wayaghe, kuya wawalekelela woke.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ako Bereya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Chilo hachingile iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu wawaghala Pauli na Sila ako Bereya. Hawapfikile ako, waghenda mne ing'anda ye ukulombela ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Iwanu wa Bereya wang'ali wotegheletsa pfinoghile kubita iwanu wa Tesalonike. Kwaapfila waibokela imbuli kwa kusulukila, na chila litsuwa wang'ali woghalola ghoya Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, wone ka Pauli ang'ali yolongesa. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Wayahudi wengi watoghola ka pfawatoghole iwapinga wengi wa Chigiriki wane ukulu ne iwamale wengi wa Chigiriki.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Wayahudi wa Tesalonike hawamanyile Pauli yang'ali yopeta imbuli ye Imulungu ako Bereya, pfipfila nawo waghenda ako, wandusa kulisongesa kingili lye iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Bahala iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu wamghala Pauli kumwani. Lekeni Sila na Timoteo wasighala ako Bereya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Awala iwanu iwamghalile Pauli, waghenda naye mbaka Asene. Kuya wamleka, woya na malaghitso gha tsina Sila na Timoteo ka waleke kukawa kumuwinza Pauli.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ako Asene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Pauli hayang'ali yowabeta ako Asene, honile isi ila imema pfinyagho pfingi pfe milungu, kehilwa mmoyo mwake. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Apfo ang'ali yolonga na Wayahudi na Wagiriki iwompfuka Imulungu mne ing'anda ye ukulombela. Pfipfila chila litsuwa yang'ali yolonga ne iwanu iyatingane nawo mne ghulilo. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Iwanu wa Epikuro na Stoiki iwang'ali welangulitsa falisafa wandusa kwisonga naye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Wangi walonga, “Angu mbotsi yuno yolonga choni?” Wangi walonga, “Kakoneka kopeta mbuli tse milungu migheni.” Walonga apfo kwaapfila Pauli yang'ali yopeta imbuli ya Yesu na ukutsilihuka. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Kuya wamsola, wamghala hanu he ukutinganila ha Areopagho, wamlongela, “Utulongele malangulitso ghachi ghano gha sambi ghweghwe ghaulonga? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Kwaapfila kutughalila ipfinu pfihenza, na twetwe twobama tumanye mbuli atso tsina mana yachi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Iwanu wa Asene na iwagheni iwang'ali wokala ako tsawang'ali wotumila matsuwa ghawo ghose kulonga na kuhulikitsa mbuli tse sambi.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Apfo Pauli kema hambele ha mtingano wa Areopagho, kalonga, “Amweye iwanu wa Asene nene nakona mwemwe mwa iwanu yamuwinza dini ghendo. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kwaapfila haning'ali nibita na kulola ghoya hanu hamlombela, mbona hanu hakulapfila inambiko handikighwe. Kwe Imulungu ing'ayomanyika. Lelo nene nowapetela mbuli tsake yuyo yamumtambikila bila kummanya.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Imulungu iyalumbile isi na pfinu pfose ipfili mumo, ka Imtwatsa wa kulanga na iisi, ng'okala bae mne ng'anda tse Imulungu itsitsengighwe kwa ghamoko ghe iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Wala ng'otumikighwa kwa ghamoko ghe iwanu, ka yeye kobama ichinu chochose, kwaapfila yeye imwenyegho koweng'a iwanu wose ughima na muhe na ipfinu pfose. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kulawa kwe imunu yumwe, katenda ghamataifa ghose ghe iwanu ghakale mne iisi yose. Tsakalamla kulawa ghumwande, tsuwachi na kwani ghamataifa agho ghang'akalile. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Imulungu katenda apfo ili iwanu wambame na wamwone hata kwa kubumbulitsa bumbulitsa, hata apfo Imulungu ng'ali kutali bae ne iwanu wose. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />‘Kwaapfila kuna yeye twetwe twokala, twoghenda na kuwa na ughima wetu.’ Ka yumwe wenu imtunga wila pfalongile, ‘Twetwe wose twa mweleko wake’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />“Apfo kwaapfila twetwe twa mweleko ghwe Imulungu, ng'atubamighwa bae kwalangula ka Imulungu keghala na nzahabu au fetsa au libwe, ipfinu ipfisongolighwe ghoya kwe tsimbutsi tse iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ghumwande Imulungu tsakatenda ka ng'akona bae ghamatsuwa ghala iwanu hawakalile wabotsi, lekeni lelo kowalaghitsa iwanu wose chila hanu watsileke nzambi tsawo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kwaapfila Imulungu keka litsuwa hayatsoihinya iisi kwa haki kwa imunu yula iyamsaghule. Kawatenda iwanu wose wamtoghole kwa kumtsilihula imunu ayo.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Hawamhulike Pauli kolonga imbuli ya ukutsilihuka, wangi wamseka, lekeni wangi walonga, “Twobama tuhulikitse keli imbuli ino.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Baho Pauli kawaleka, koka. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Iwanu wangi wamuwinza Pauli na wamtoghola Yesu. Mna wawo tsakakala Diyonesiyo, imunu wa Areopago. Pfipfila kukala ne ipinga yumwe iyakemighwe Damari na iwanu wangi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Pauli ako Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Kuya Pauli kalawa Asene kaghenda Kolinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ako ketingana na Myahudi yumwe yakemighwe Akila, yelekighwe Ponto, iyatsile na mwehe wake Pilisila kulawa Italiya matsuwa ghaghala, kwaapfila mndewa Kilaudi tsakawalaghitsa Wayahudi wose walawe Roma. Pauli kaghenda kuwona, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />na kwaapfila isang'ano yake tsaikala kutenda pfibumbughitsa ka wawo, kakala nawo na kusang'ana nawo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Chila Litsuwa lya Sabato Pauli tsakakala kolonga na iwanu mne ing'anda ye ukulombela, kaghetsa kuwakwegha Wayahudi na Wagiriki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila na Timoteo hawatsile kulawa Makedoniya, Pauli katumila chipindi chake chose kuwapetela Wayahudi na kuwalangusa ka Yesu kakala Kiristu Mkombotsi. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Lekeni hawambelile Pauli ne ukumligha, kakung'usa maghwanda ghake, kawalongela “Mng'agha, lwenu! Nene nahela litotso mne imbuli ino. Kulawa sambi na kughendelela noghenda kuna iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Kuya Pauli kalawa mne Ing'anda ye ukulombela, kaghenda mne ing'anda ili habehi, ing'anda ya Tito Yusti, imunu iyomtamanila Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kirispo imkulu we ing'anda ye ukulombela na iwanu wa ukaye yake wamtoghola Imtwatsa. Na Wakolinto wengi hawahulike, watoghola na kubatitsighwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Litsuwa limwe nechilo, Imtwatsa kamlongela Pauli mne ghamaono, “Uleke kupfuka, ghendelela kulonga, uleke kwinyamala. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Kwaapfila nene na hamwe naghwe, kuduhu imunu iyodaha kukulagha, kwaapfila nina iwanu wengi mne isi ino.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Apfo Pauli kakala ako mwaka ghumwe na miyetsi sita, kowalangulitsa iwanu imbuli ye Imulungu.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Galiyo hayang'ali imkulu we isi ya Akaya, Wayahudi wetingana hamwe, wamghogha Pauli, wamghala mne ichitala. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Walonga, “Imunu yuno kowatenda iwanu wamtamanile Imulungu bila kughawinza malaghitso gha Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Na Pauli hayabamile kulonga, Galiyo kawalongela Wayahudi, “Ka mng'aghalile lighomba lye imunu kutenda ghehile au kutotsa, ning'adahile kuwahulikitsa. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Lekeni kwaapfila lighomba lino lya mchanya mwe mbuli na mataghwa na malaghitso ghenu, mlamle iwenyegho. Nene sibama bae kuwa mlamutsi wa lighomba lino!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Kuya kawawinga walawe mne ichitala. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Nawo wose wamghogha Sostene imkulu we ing'anda ya ukulombela, wamtowa hambele he ichitala. Lekeni Galiyo ng'onile bae imbuli ayo ka chinu.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kakuya keli Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pauli kakala Korinto kwa matsuwa mengi. Kuya kawaleka iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu, kadina mnumbwi Pilisila na Akila waghenda Siriya. Ako Kenkeliya, tsakagheta mvili tsake kwaapfila tsakeka laghano. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Wapfika Efeso, baho Pauli kawaleka Pilisila na Akila, kengila mne ing'anda ya ukulombela, kalonga na Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Iwanu wamlomba wakale naye kwa matsuwa mengi, lekeni Pauli kalema. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Lekeni hayang'ali yakuka, kawalongela, “Imulungu ang'abama nakuya keli kuna mwemwe.” Kuya kadina mnumbwi kalawa Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Hapfikile Kaisariya, kaghenda Yerusalemu kwilamsa na iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu, kuya kahulumkila Antiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Pauli kakala ako kwa matsuwa chidogho, kuya koka kabitila isi ya Galatiya na Firigiya, kuwaghuma ghumoyo iwanang'ina wa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Mne matsuwa agho Myahudi yumwe iyakemighwe Apolo, iyelekighwe Alekisandiliya, katsa Efeso. Tsakakala imunu yadahile kulonga pfinoghile na yamanyile Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Imunu ayo tsakakala kalangulitsighwa Imbuli ye Imtwatsa, na kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwake tsaghukala ghwakwaka, kalangulitsa mbuli tsa Yesu pfinoghile, hata ka tsakamanya ubatitso wa Yohane uliyeka. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Kandusa kulonga bila kupfuka mne ing'anda ya ukulombela. Pilisila na Akila hawamuhulike, wamkema ukaye yawo, wamlongela Imbuli ye Imulungu pfinoghile ghendo. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolo hayabamile kughenda Akaya, iwanu wa Efeso iwamtoghole Yesu wawaghuma ghumoyo na wawandikila ibaluwa iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu wa Akaya wambokele. Naye hayapfikile ako, kawapfila ng'ani awala iwatoghole kwa uluso we Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Kwaapfila tsakawahuma ghendo Wayahudi hambele he iwanu wose, kalangusa kulawa mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ka Yesu iyo Kiristu Mkombotsi.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Pauli ako Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolo hayang'ali Kolinto, Pauli kabitila isi itsili mpfidunda, kuya kapfika Efeso. Baho kawapfika iwanu wangi iwomtoghola Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />kawaghutsa, “Angu tsamumbokela Muhe Mwenzeluka hala hamtoghole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Wamwidika, “Mbe, hata kuhulika ka kuna Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka ng'ana tuhulike bae.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Pauli kawaghutsa, “Kuya tsambatitsighwa ubatitso wachi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Wamwidika, “Ubatitso iyang'ali yobatitsa Yohane.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Pauli kalonga, “Ubatitso wang'ali yobatitsa Yohane tsaukala kwa awala iwatoghole kutsileka nzambi tsawo. Naye tsakawalongela iwanu wamtoghole ayula iyakutsa kuchughu kwake, ayo iyo Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Hawahulike pfino, wabatitsighwa kwa taghwa lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Pauli hayamalitse kuwekila ghamoko, Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kawahulumkila, nawo wandusa ukulonga lugha ingi, pfipfila walonga mbuli ye Imtwatsa. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Tsawakala iwanu ka kumi na weli.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Pauli kengila mne ing'anda ye ukulombela, kwa miyetsi midatu kalonga ne iwanu bila kupfuka, tsakaghetsa kuwakwegha watse mne Undewa we Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Lekeni wamwenga tsawana mimoyo mikomu na ng'awatoghole bae, na wailonga pfihile Imbuli ye Imtwatsa. Apfo Pauli kawaleka, kawasola iwatoghole, kalonga nawo chila litsuwa mne ing'anda ya ukulangulitsila ya imunu yumwe iyakemighwe Tirano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Pfinu pfino pfighendelela kwa miyaka mili, ili iwanu wose iwokala mne kaye tse isi ya Asiya, Wayahudi na iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae wahulike imbuli ye Imtwatsa.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Sikewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Imulungu tsayang'ali yotenda pfihulo pfikulu kubitila Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Hata pfitambala na maghwanda ghayakindile ghaghalighwa kwe iwatamu, utamu wawo uwalawa, na ipfinyamkela pfiwalawa. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Wayahudi wamwenga iwakwangakwanga na kulapfa ipfinyamkela tsawaghetsa kutumila taghwa lya Imtwatsa. Wawalongela ipfinyamkela, “Nomlaghitsani mlawe kwa taghwa lya Yesu, iyopetighwa na Pauli.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Iwatendile apfo, tsawakala iwana saba wa imunu yumwe Myahudi iyakemighwe Sikewa, iyakalile Imtambika mkulu.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Lekeni ichinyamkela kawalongela, “Yesu nommanya, Pauli nommanya, lekeni mwemwe tsina nani?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Kuya imunu yane ichinyamkela kawadalukila, kawatowa mbaka watsumila kunze mwe ing'anda wachidako aku wana pfilonda.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Imbuli ayo haimanyike na Wayahudi na Wagiriki iwokala ako Efeso, wose tsawapfuka, na taghwa lya Imtwatsa Yesu litunyighwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Iwanu wengi iwamtoghole Yesu watsa hambele he iwanu, watoghola kuleka kutenda ghehile. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Iwanu wamwenga iwang'ali wotenda uhawi wapfighala pfitabu pfawo na kupfilakatsa hambele he iwanu. Pfawapetile bei ye ipfitabu apfo, wona yodahika kupfika elufu hamsini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa matsuwa agho, sendi imwe tsaikala maliho gha sang'ano ya tsuwa limwe.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Apfo imbuli ye Imtwatsa yenela na kuwa ne ingupfu ghendo.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hengele lyolawila ako Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Pfinu pfino hapfimalile, Pauli tsakalamla aghende Yerusalemu kwa kubitila Makedoniya na Akaya, kalonga, “Ning'apfika ako, pfipfila nobamighwa ng'ende Roma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Apfo kawatuma ako Makedoniya iwanu wake weli iwomwapfilagha, Timoteo na Elasto, yeye mwenyegho tsakakala chidogho ako Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ghamatsuwa ghala tsakulawila hengele kulu ako Efeso kwaajili ya mbuli tsa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Tsahana imunu yumwe taghwa lyake Demetiriyo iyang'ali yotenda ipfinyagho pfa fetsa pfe imulungu Atemi. Isang'ano ayo iwatenda Demetiriyo ne iwanu wake wabwede ghendo. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Apfo Demeteriyo kawakema iwanu wake, na iwanu wangi iwosang'ana isang'ano ka yake, kalonga, “Mweye wayangu, mwomanya twopata sendi nyingi kwa isang'ano ino. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Mwemwe muwenyegho tsamuhulika na mwona ka si hano Efeso haliyeka bae, ila Asiya yose, Pauli kawakwegha iwanu na kughalusa ghamawatso ghawo, kalonga milungu itendighwe ne iwanu si milungu bae. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Apfo isang'ano yetu itsobetsighwa, na si isang'ano yetu iliyeka bae, ila hata ing'anda ye imulungu wetu mamo Atemi nayo itsobetsighwa na mlungu wetu imwenyegho katsobetsighwa, imulungu yotambikighwa mne kaye tsa Asiya na mne isi yose, katsobokighwa utunitso wake!”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Hawahulike apfo, wona maya wandusa kukemelela, “Atemi wa Efeso ka Mkulu!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Tsakulawila hengele mne isi yose. Iwanu wawaghogha Gayo ne Aristariko, iwanu iwelongotse na Pauli kulawa Makedoniya, watsuma nawo mbaka hane chibugha che midawalo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pauli imwenyegho tsakabama aghende hambele he iwanu, lekeni iwanang'ina wake wamghoma. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Hata iwakulu wangi we Asiya, sale tsake Pauli, wamtumila imunu wamlomba aleke kughenda hane chibugha che imidawalo. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Imtingano ukala uhinyika, iwanu wamwenga wang'ali wolonga achi na wamwenga wolonga chila, kwaapfila iwanu wengi ng'awamanyile tsawetinganile choni. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Wayahudi wangi wamghala Alekisanda hambele he iwanu, na iwanu wangi wamkemelela. Naye kawapungila ghumoko iwanu wanyamale, ili yeyamile kwe iwanu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Lekeni hawamanyile yeye ka Myahudi, wose wakemelela hamwe kwa masaa meli, “Atemi wa Efeso ka mkulu!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Na kalani wa isi hayamalitse kuwalongela iwanu wanyamale, kalonga, “Mwemwe iwanu wa Efeso, angu yuhi ng'amanyile bae ka isi ya Efeso iyo mkalitsi wa ing'anda ye imulungu mkulu Atemi na mkalitsi wa chinyagho chake ichilaghale kulawa kulanga? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Kwaapfila kuduhu imunu yodaha kubela agho, apfo mnyamale na mleke kutenda chinu chochose himahima. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Muwaghala hano iwanu wano, nawo ng'awebile ipfinu pfe ing'anda ye imulungu wala ng'awamlighile bae mlungu wetu. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Apfo, ka Demetiriyo na weyaghe wana lighomba na imunu wowose, ghamabalatsa na iwalamutsi wabaho. Wodaha kughala ako lighomba alyo. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Lekeni ka mna ghomba lingi, mwobamighwa mlighale kune libalatsa ilibamighwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kwaapfila tung'aghalighwa mne libalatsa kwaajili ya hengele lya leloli, ng'atudaha kwiyamila bae kwaapfila hengele lino lyahela mana.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Hayamalitse ukulonga apfi, kawalongela iwanu woke.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Pauli koghenda keli Makedoniya na Ugiriki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Hengele lila lya Efeso halimalile Pauli kawakema iwomtoghola Yesu, kawaghuma ghumoyo, kawaagha kuya kaghenda Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Hayang'ali yobita kaye tsila, kawaghuma ghumoyo iwanu, kuya kapfika Ugiriki, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />kakala ako kwa miyetsi midatu. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Tsaang'ali yelongotsa na Sopato imwana we Pilo iyolawila Bereya, Aristariko na Sekundo iwanu wa Tesalonike, Gayo imunu wa Deribe, Timoteo, Tukiko na Tirofimo iwolawa Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Iwanu awo tsawalongola na watubeta ako Tirowa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ichihungo che Pfighate ipfilihela hamila hachimalile, tudina mnumbwi kulawa Filipi, na ghamatsuwa matano hambele tutingana nawo ako Tirowa, tukala ako kwa ghamatsuwa saba.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Mne litsuwa lya mwanduso lya juma, tsatutingana hamwe na ukuja chijo. Pauli tsakalonga ne iwanu, na kwaapfila kabama yoke litsuwa lya keli kaghendelela kulonga nawo mbaka nechilo ng'ani. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Tsahana ipfitasa pfingi ipfing'ali pfakwaka mne ichiheleto ichili kuchanya, hanu hatwitinganile. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Msongolo yumwe yakemighwe Yutiko tsakala hane lidilisha. Pauli hayang'ali yoghendelela kulonga, Yutiko ang'ali yodongila, kadongila mbaka kalaghala, kulawa mne igholofa ya kadatu mbaka hasi. Hawaghendile kumwinula wampfika ma kafa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Lekeni Pauli kahulumka hasi, kamwinamila, kamkumbatila msongolo ayo. Kalonga, “Mleke kupfuka, kamghima!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Kuya kadina keli mchanya, kasola chijo kaja, kaghendelela kulonga nawo mbaka habehi na kucha, kuya koka. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Iwanu wamghala imsongolo yula ukaye kamghima, nawo waghumighwa ghumoyo.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulawa Tirowa kughenda Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Twetwe tudina imeli tulongola kughenda Aso ili twitingane na Pauli. Tsakatulongela tutende apfo, kwaapfila yeye ang'ali yoghenda ako kwa mghulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Hatupfikile Aso, Pauli kengila mne ghumnumbwi, tughenda naye Mitileni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Litsuwa lya keli twandusa ghumwanza kulawa ako kuya tupfika Kiyo. Litsuwa lya kadatu tupfika Samo, na litsuwa lya kane tupfika Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Pauli kalamla aghendelele na ghumwanza bila kubitila Efeso ili aleke kukawa mne isi ya Asiya. Tsakabama yasumke kupfika Yerusalemu kwaajili ya ichihungo cha Pentekoste ka ing'adahike.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kowaagha iwabala wa Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kulawa Mileto, Pauli kawatuma iwanu waghende Efeso kuwakema iwabala we iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu wetingane naye. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Hawatsile, kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwomanya pfanikalile ghamatsuwa ghose, hanikalile namwe kulawa litsuwa lya mwanduso lyanitsile mne isi ya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Tsanimsang'anila Imtwatsa bila kwighoda na kwa masotsi, hata ka tsanigetsighwa ng'ani na aghala ghehile ghawanendele Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mwomanya silekile bae kuwalongela chila ichinu ichidaha kumwapfilani mwemwe, ila niwalangulitsa hambele he iwanu na kulawa ing'anda mbaka ing'anda. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Niwalongela wose Wayahudi na iwanu iwali si Wayahudi wamuyile Imulungu na wamtoghole Imtwatsa wetu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Na lelo, kwaapfila nimuhulika Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka, noghenda Yerusalemu aku simanyile bae choni chitsonilawila ako. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Chinu chimwe chanimanya, Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka konongela ka mna chila ghumji, ukwohighwa na ukughaya pfonibeta. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Lekeni siwona bae ughima wangu ka chinu chikulu, ila chanibama kumalitsa isang'ano yangaile Imtwatsa Yesu, isang'ano ye ukupeta Imbuli Inoghile ya uluso we Imulungu.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Nibita mna mwemwe wose kuwapetela Undewa we Imulungu, lekeni sambi nomanya ka kuduhu imunu mna mwemwe iyatsombona keli. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Apfo leloli nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose mna mwemwe ang'agha, alwo lwenu, nene nahela totso. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kwaapfila silekile bae kuwalongela ghose ghayobama Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Mwalangitse iwenyegho, na muwalolese iwanu wose awala Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka iyamwikeni muwalongotse, muwadime awala iwomtoghola Imulungu iyawaghulile kwa idamu yake imwenyegho. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Nomanya nene hanikuka, wambwa wakali wa kumuhulo watsowatsilani na ng'awatsowonelani libatsi bae. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Hata mna mwemwe muwenyegho watsolawila iwanu iwolonga ughutsu ili wawakweghe kuna wawo awala iwomtoghola Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Apfo mwalangitse! Mkumbuke, kwa miyaka midatu chilo na misi, silekile bae kumlangulitsa chila imunu iyali kuna mwemwe kwa masotsi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Lelo nomwikani mne ghamoko ghe Imulungu na mne imbuli ya uluso wake iudaha kuwatsenga na kuwatenda muhale hamwe na iwanu wake. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Sibamile bae nzahabu au fetsa au lighwanda lya imunu wowose. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Mwemwe muwenyegho mwomanya ka tsanisang'ana kwa ghamoko ghangu ili kupata aghala ghanibamile na aghala ghawabamile weyangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mne chila chinu chanendile, tsaniwalangusa ka kwa kusang'ana ka pfino, twobamighwa kuwapfila iwanu walihela ingupfu, mkumbuke chayalongile Imtwatsa Yesu imwenyegho, ‘Kabweda ayula iyoghola kubita ayula iyobokela.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Hayamalitse kulonga agho, katowa ghamaghoti hamwe nawo, kamlomba Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Wose walila hawang'ali womuagha Pauli kuno wamkumbatila na wamnonela. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Tsawona usungu ng'ani kwaapfila kawalongela ng'awatsomwona keli bae. Kuya waghenda naye mbaka kune imeli.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pauli koghenda Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Tsatuwaagha, kuya tudina imeli tughenda mbaka Kosi. Litsuwa liwinzile tupfika Rode, na kulawa ako tupfika Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ako tuipfika imeli iighenda Foinike, apfo tudina, tuka. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Na hatuyonile Kupulo, tubita lubali lwake lwe kuisi, tughenda mbaka Siriya. Tuhulumkila Tiro kwaapfila ako mnumbwi wetu ghung'ali ghwohulumsa imitsigho. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ako tuwapfika iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu, tukala nawo ghamatsuwa saba. Kwa ingupfu ya Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka wamghoma Pauli aleke kughenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Lekeni ghamatsuwa ghetu haghamalile, tughendelela na ghumwanza ghwetu. Iwanu wose iwamtoghole Yesu na wehe tsawo ne iwana wawo watuhilika mbaka kunze kwe ghumji, na baho tutowa maghoti, tulomba. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Hatumalitse kuwaagha, tudina imeli, nawo woya mmakaye mwawo. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Tughendelela na ghumwanza kulawa Tiro, tupfika Tolemayi, baho tuwalamsa iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu na kukala nawo kwa litsuwa limwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Nemitondo tuka, tupfika Kaisariya. Ako tsatukala mne ing'anda ya Filipi, mpetela wanu imbuli inoghile, iyakalile yumwe wa awala saba iwasaghulighwe Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Imunu yuno tsakakala ne iwanaghe wapinga wane, awo ng'ana wakwelighwe bae, wang'ali wolonga usenga we Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Hatukalile baho kwa ghamatsuwa mengi, nabii yumwe we Imulungu iyakemighwe Agabo katsa kulawa Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Katutsila, kasola ghumsipi ghwa Pauli, keyoha ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghake imwenyegho, kalonga, “Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kolonga, Wayahudi wa Yerusalemu watsomwoha apfino imunu yane ghumsipi ghuno na watsomwika mne ghamoko ghe awanu iwali si Wayahudi bae.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Hatuhulike apfi, twetwe na iwanu iwakalile hala tumlomba Pauli aleke kughenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Lekeni Pauli kedika, “Ebali mwolila na mwoghutenda ghumoyo ghwangu ghutenyuke? Nene niyandaa si kwohighwa kuliyeka bae, ila hata ukufila Yerusalemu kwaajili ya taghwa lya Imtwatsa Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Halemile kututegheletsa, tumleka, tulonga, “Ghayobama Imulungu ghatendeke.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Hatumalitse kukala hala, twoha pfinu pfetu tugheluka tughenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Iwanu wangi iwomtoghola Yesu kulawa Kaisariya welongotsa na twetwe, watughala tukakale ukaye kwa Mnasoni. Yeye tsakakala imunu wa Kupulo, naye yang'ali yomtoghola Yesu kwa ghamatsuwa mengi.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli Komwangila Yakobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Hatupfikile Yerusalemu, iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu watubokela kwa kudeng'elela. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Litsuwa liwinzile Pauli na twetwe tsatughenda kumwona Jakobu, na iwabala wose we iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu tsawabaho. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Pauli kawalamsa na kuwalongela ghose ghayatendile Imulungu kubitila isang'ano yake kwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Hawahulike apfi, wamtunya Imulungu. Kuya wamlongela Pauli, “Ndughu yetu, kwakona Wayahudi iwatoghole pfawali wengi ng'ani, nawo wose wosulukila ng'ani kutenda malaghitso gha Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Tsawalongelighwa ka ghweghwe kowalangulitsa Wayahudi wose iwokala mghati mwa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi waghaleke malaghitso gha Musa, tsakuwalongela waleke kuwengitsa ngoma iwana wawo wala kuchiwinza ichihendo chetu. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Lelo tutendetse? Kwaapfila watsohulika ka ghweghwe kwa baha, <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />apfo tenda achi chatukulongela. Ahano hana iwanu wane iwekile laghano. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Uwasole iwanu wano, wideghetese nawo, uwalihile sendi, ili waghetighwe mvili tsawo. Kuya chila imunu katsomanya ka mbuli tsako tsawahulike ng'atsilongesa bae, ila ghweghwe imwenyegho koghawinza ghamalaghitso gha Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ka pfatuwaandikile iwanu iwali si Wayahudi iwamtoghole Yesu, wobamighwa waleke ukuja ipfijo ipfitambikighwe kwa ipfinyagho, waleke ukuja idamu, waleke ukuja imnyama iyabotighwe na waleke utsinzi.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Litsuwa liwinzile Pauli kawasola iwanu awo na kwideghetesa nawo. Kuya kengila mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu kuwalongela litsuwa lye ukumalitsa ukwideghesa na litsuwa lye kulapfa nambiko kwaajili ya chila yumwe mna wawo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ghamatsuwa ghala saba haghakalile habehi kumala, Wayahudi iwalawile Asiya wamwona Pauli mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Wawasongetsa iwanu wose wamuhile Pauli, wamghogha, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />wakemela, “Amweye wamale wa Isiraeli, mtwapfile! Hayuno iyo imunu iyakwanga chila hanu, na kuwalangulitsa iwanu wose waleke kuwawinza Waisiraeli na ghamalaghitso gha Musa na hanu hano hanoghile. Kuya kawaghala iwanu iwali si Wayahudi mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, na kuhahinya hanu hano hahenzeluke.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Wamwenga tsawapfikitsa Pauli kamghala Tirofimo imunu wa Efeso mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, kwaapfila tsawamwona naye mkaye. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ghumji ghose ghukala na hengele, na iwanu wang'ali wotsuma kulawa chila hanu. Wamghogha Pauli, wamkwegha kulawa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, na bahala imibani ye Ing'anda ye Imulungu ihindighwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Na hawang'ali wobama inzila ye ukumkoma Pauli, imbuli impfikila imkulu we asikali wa Roma ka ghumji ghose ghwa Yerusalemu ghukala na hengele. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Bahala imkulu hayo kawasola iwakulu wangi hamwe na asikali katsuma kuhulumkila mne kingili. Nawo hawamwonile imkulu ayo ne asikali wake, waleka kumtowa Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Imkulu ayo kamghendela Pauli, kamghogha, kalaghitsa yohighwe minyororo mili. Kuya kaghutsa, “Angu ayuno imunu wachi? Kuya atendile choni?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Iwanu wangi mne mtingano agho walonga pfino na wamwenga walonga apfino, imkulu hayo ng'adahile kuhulika ghoya kwaapfila tsahana tsogho, apfo kalaghitsa Pauli yaghalighwe mne liboma. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Pauli hayapfikile mna ingatsi, asikali wamsola kwaapfila iwanu wang'ali wotenda hengele ng'ani. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Likingili limuwinza na iwanu waghendelela kukemelela, “Mkomeni ayo!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Pauli hayang'ali yoghalighwa mng'anda, kamlomba imkulu we asikali, “Uleke tanu nikulongele ichinu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Naye kamghutsa, “Kumbe kodaha kulonga Chigiriki!” <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Pfii ghweghwe si yula Mmisiri yandusile uasi ghamatsuwa ghabitile na kuwalongotsa kunyika iwanu wala wehile elufu nne?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pauli kedika, “Bae, nene na Myahudi wa Taso, ako Kilikiya, isi imanyika ng'ani. Nolomba undeke nonge ne iwanu wano.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Imbala ayo hayamlekile alonge, Pauli kema mngatsi, kawapungila ghumoko iwanu wanyamale. Kuya wose hawanyamale, Pauli kalonga nawo kwa Chihebraniya.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Ndughu tsangu na aba tsangu, mnihulikitse ghoya pfaniyamila hambele henu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Hawahulike kolonga nawo Chihebraniya, wenyamala tulu, naye Pauli kaghendelela kulonga,<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Nene na Myahudi, nyelekighwa Taso, isi ya Kilikiya, lekeni nikulila mne ghumji ghuno. Tsanikala imwanang'ina wa Gamalieli, tsanilangulitsighwa kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghe iwabala wetu. Na ng'ala nosulukila kumuhulikitsa Imulungu ka mwemwe mwose pfamli leloli. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Tsaniwadununza iwanu iwoiwinza inzila ino mbaka kuwakoma, tsaniwaghogha wose iwamale ne iwapinga na kuwasa mwigheletsa. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Imtambika mkulu ne libalatsa lyose lyodaha kulapfa ukalangama. Wawo iwo iwangaile ibaluwa niighale kwa Wayahudi wa Damasko, ili niwaghoghe iwanu awo ako Damasko niwaghale Yerusalemu wahighighwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kolonga pfayaghaluke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Ghama 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">Ghama 26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Nemisi haning'ali mnzila, hamvikile habehi na Damasko, bahala lumwesa lukulu kulawa kulanga lunimwemwesela chila hanu. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Nyighwa hasi, kuya nihulika litsi lyonilongela, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Ebali konidununza?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nimghutsa, ‘Imtwatsa ghweghwe uli nani?’ Kanongela, ‘Nene na Yesu wa Natsareti, yunidununza.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Wayangu wawona lumwesa, lekeni ng'awahulike bae litsi lya ayula iyalongile na nene. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Nimghutsa, ‘Imtwatsa lelo nendetse?’ Imtwatsa kanongela. ‘Winuke ughende Damasko, ako kutsolongelighwa ghose ghaubamighwa kutenda.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Weyangu wang'inda ghumoko, wanongotsa mbaka Damasko, kwaapfila sidahile bae ukwona kwaajili ya ukulu wa lumwesa lula.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Imunu yumwe yakemighwe Ananiya tsakatsa kumbona, imunu ayo tsakakala kompfuka Imulungu na koghakinda ghamalaghitso gha Musa na kotegheletsighwa na Wayahudi wose iwokala ako. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Kema habehi yangu, kalonga, ‘Ndughu yangu Sauli, wone keli!’ Na bahala nidaha kumwona. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Kuya Ananiya kalonga, ‘Imulungu we iwabala wetu kakusaghula ghweghwe umanye chayobama na umwone ayula Mwenzeluka wake na uhulike litsi lyake. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe kutsakuwa mkalangama wake kwa kuwalongela iwanu wose aghala ghawonile na ghauhulike. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Lelo ubeta choni? Winuke, ubatitsighwe, uleghusighwe nzambi tsako kwa kulitoghola taghwa lyake.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kokemighwa kuwapetela iwanu iwali si Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Hambuyile Yerusalemu na haning'ali nilomba mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, ng'ala ka nitsilika. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Nimwona Imtwatsa konongela, ‘Sambi baha ulawe Yerusalemu! Kwaapfila ng'awatsotoghola ukalangama wako mne mbuli tsangu.’<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nimwidika, ‘Imtwatsa, iwanu womanya ka nene tsang'enda mne tsing'anda tse Imulungu kuwaghogha na kuwatowa iwanu wose iwakutoghole. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Na imkalangama wako Stefani hayakomighwe, nene tsanabaho, nitoghola kukomighwa kwake, na tsang'ala noghalolesa maghwanda ghe awala iwamkomile.<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />“Kuya Imtwatsa kanongela, ‘Ghenda, nokutuma kutali kwe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Iwanu wamtegheletsa Pauli mbaka hayalongile apfi. Kuya wandusa kukemelela, “Mkomeni hayo! Munu ka ayo ng'obamighwa bae kukala muisi!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Hawang'ali wokemelela na ukwasa ghamaghwanda ghawo na ukupwililisa litimbwisi uchanya, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />imkulu we asikali kalaghitsa Pauli yaghalighwe mne liboma, kuya kalaghitsa wamghutse kwa kumtowa pfiboko, ili amanye ule iwanu womkemelela pfila. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Lekeni hawang'ali womwoha wamtowe, Pauli kamlongela imkulu yumwe we asikali yemile habehi, “Apfi pfinogha mwemwe kumpfapula Mroma ng'ana yahighighwe bae?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Imkulu ayo hahulike apfi, kaghenda kumlongela imkulu we asikali imbuli ayo, kalonga “Angu ubama kutenda choni? Imunu ayu Mroma.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Apfo imkulu we asikali kamghendela Pauli, kamghutsa, “Nongele, ghweghwe kwa Mroma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Pauli kamwidika, “Ona.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Imkulu ayo kalonga, “Tsaniliha sendi nyingi ili niwe Mroma.” Pauli kamwidika, “Nene na mwenye kaye wa Roma kwa kwelekighwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Bahala awala iwabamile kumghutsa Pauli wandusa kuka. Na imkulu we asikali hayamanyile Pauli tsakakala Mroma kapfuka, kwaapfila tsakamwoha.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kamne libaratsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Litsuwa lya keli, imkulu we asikali tsakabama amanye ghendo ule Wayahudi wamwing'a lighomba Pauli, kampfughula na kawalaghitsa iwakulu we inambiko na libaratsa lyose wetingane. Kuya kamghala Pauli, kamwika hambele hawo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pauli kawatsodelela tsinenge iwanu wa libaratsa, kuya kalonga, “Ndughu tsangu, tsanimtumikila Imulungu kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile mbaka leloli.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Imtambika mkulu Ananiya kawalaghitsa awala iwakalile habehi na Pauli wamtowe mlomo wake. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Kuya Pauli kamlongela, “Imulungu katsokutowa ghweghwe mng'enye. Ghweghwe kwa hano kunihigha kwa ghamalaghitso, lekeni ghweghwe imwenyegho koghahinya ghamalaghitso kwa kuwalongela iwanu wanitowe!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Awala iwemile habehi na Pauli walonga, “Ghweghwe, komligha mtambika mkulu we Imulungu!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pauli kedika, “Ndughu tsangu, simanyile bae ka yeye ka mtambika mkulu, kwaapfila yandikighwa, ‘uleke kumlonga pfihile imtawala we iwanu wako.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Kuya Pauli hayamanyile ka iwanu iwakalile hala, wamwenga tsawakala Masadukayo na wangi tsawakala Mafarisayo, kakemelela mne libaratsa lila, “Ndughu tsangu, nene na Mfarisayo, mwana wa Mfarisayo. Nene nohighighwa kwaapfila notoghola ka iwanu iwafile watsotsilihuka!”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Baha hayalongile apfo, Masadukayo na Mafarisayo wandusa kwisonga, baho mtingano ghwighola. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Kwaapfila Masadukayo wolonga kuduhu ukutsilihuka kwe iwanu, kuduhu wamalaika wala muhe, ila Mafarisayo wotoghola ghose agho.<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Tsakulawila hengele kulu, na iwalangulitsi wa ghamalaghitso iwakalile Mafarisayo wema, walonga kwa ingupfu, “Ng'atukona bae ichinu chochose ichihile kwa imunu ayu. Lamda malaika we Imulungu au muhe kalonga naye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Hengele tsalikala kulu ng'ani, na ayula imkulu we asikali kapfuka iwanu wang'amghanile Pauli pfihindipfihindi. Apfo kalaghitsa iwanwele wahulumke, wamsole kwa ingupfu kulawa mne ghamoko ghawo, kuya wamghale mne liboma. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Chilo chila Imtwatsa tsakema habehi na Pauli, kamlongela, “Uleke kupfuka! Ka pfauwalongele mbuli tsangu iwanu wa hano Yerusalemu, pfipfila kobamighwa uwalongele iwanu Roma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wobama inzila ye ukumkoma Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Nemitondo yake Wayahudi watingana, welaghana waleke ukuja wala ukunwa ichinu chochose mbaka hawatsomkoma Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Na iwanu iwatendile apfo tsawakala wabita iwanu alubaini. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Kuya waghenda kwe iwatambika wakulu ne iwabala, wawalongela, “Twilaha kuleka ukuja na ukunwa mbaka hatutsomkoma Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Lelo mwemwe ne iwabala wa libaratsa mumlombe imkulu we asikali amghale Pauli kuna mwemwe, mtende ka mwobama kumanya pfinoghile mbuli tsake. Na twetwe twombeta mnzila tumkome ng'ana yapfike hano.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Lekeni mwighwaghe Pauli tsakahulika imbuli ayo, apfo kaghenda mne liboma, kamlongela Pauli mbuli ayo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Kuya Pauli kamkema mkulu yumwe we asikali kamlongela, “Umghale imsongolo yuno kwa imkulu we asikali, kana chinu kobama yamlongele.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Imkulu ayo kamsola imsongolo yula kamghala kwa imkulu we asikali, kamlongela, “Pauli, ayula mwohighwa tsakang'ema, kanilomba nikughalile imsongolo yuno kwaapfila kana chinu kobama yakulongele.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Imkulu we asikali kamkinda ghumoko imsongolo yula, kaghenda naye hambalimbali, kamghutsa, “Kobama unongele choni?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Kamwidika, “Wayahudi wobama wakulombe ilupfi umghale Pauli kuna libaratsa, wotenda ka wobama wamanye pfinoghile mbuli tsake. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Lekeni uleke kutoghola kwaapfila Wayahudi kubita wanu alubaini wombeta. Tsawelaha waleke ukuja wala ukunwa mbaka wamkome. Sambi wobeta, wololesa pfautsolamla.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Imkulu ayo kamlongela imsongolo ayo, “Uleke kumlongela imunu wowose ka kunongela imbuli ino.” Kuya kamleka yoke.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli koghalighwa Kaisariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Kuya kawakema iwakulu weli we asikali, kawalaghitsa, “Muwandae asikali miya mbili na iwadina farasi sabini na asikali iwokinda imighoha miya mbili, waghende Kaisariya saa tatu nechilo. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Mumwikile Pauli iwafalasi, mumghale tseghamba kwa Felikisi imtawala wa Chiroma mne isi ya Yudeya.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Kuya kandika pfino ibaluwa,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Mbukwa ghwe imbala Felikisi. Nene Kilaudi Lisiya nokwandikila ghweghwe mtawala,<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />“Imunu yuno tsakaghoghighwa na Wayahudi na wabama wamkome, lekeni tsang'enda ne asikali kumkombola, kwaapfila tsanihulika yeye ka Mroma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Tsanibama nimanye womwing'a lighomba lyachi, apfo nimghala mne libaratsa lyawo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Tsambona wamwing'a lighomba kwaajili ya ghamalaghitso ghawo, lekeni tsakukala kuduhu totso ilimtenda yakomighwe au yohighwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Kuya hanongelighwe Wayahudi wobama inzila ye kumkoma imunu yuno, bahala nimghala kuna ghweghwe. Pfipfila niwalaghitsa iwamwing'ile lighomba walonge mbuli tsake kuna ghweghwe.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Apfo asikali wamsola Pauli ka pfawalaghitsighwe. Ichilo chichila wamghala Pauli mbaka Antipatiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Litsuwa liwinzile wawaleka awala iwadina farasi waghende naye, na asikali iwoghenda kwa imighulu woya mne liboma. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Iwadina farasi hawapfikile Kaisariya, wamwing'a ibaluwa ila imkulu ayo we isi, kuya wamwika Pauli hambele hake. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Hayamalitse kuisoma, kawaghutsa imunu yuno kalawila isi yachi? Hawamlongele kolawa Kilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />kalonga, “Nitsokutegheletsa baho iwakwing'ile lighomba hawatsokutsa hano.” Kuya kalaghitsa Pauli alolesighwe mne ing'anda ye undewa ya Herodi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Pauli hane libalatsa lya Feliksi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ghamatsuwa matano hambele, Imtambika mkulu Ananiya kahulumka Kaisariya hamwe ne iwabala ne imunu yumwe we ghamalaghitso yakemighwe Tetulo. Wamlongela imkulu ayo mbuli tsa Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Pauli hakemighwe, Tetulo kandusa kulonga hambele he Feliksi. “Ghwe mbala, tsatudeng'elela kukala tseghamba kwa ghamatsuwa mengi mne utawala wako, na ipfinu pfingi ipfibamighwa pfitendighwa kwaajili ye isi yetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Agho ghose twoghabokela na kukutoghola chila hanu ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Sibama bae kukutenda wipfe, lekeni nolomba utududumile na ututegheletse chidogho. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Tumwona imunu yuno ka mghobo, kandusa hengele mghati mwa Wayahudi wose muisi mwose. Naye ka chilongotsi wa Wanatsareti. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Yeye pfipfila tsakabama aihinye Ing'anda ye Imulungu, apfo tumghogha na tubama tumuhighe kwa ghamalaghitso ghetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Lekeni Lisiya, imkulu we iwang'ewele katsa, kumsola kwe ingupfu, kuya kawalaghitsa awala iwamwing'ile lighomba watse kuna ghweghwe. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Naghwe ung'amghutsa imunu yuno, kwodaha kughamanya ghose ighatutendile tumwing'e ghamaghomba.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Wayahudi nawo waghatoghola ghamaghomba agho, walonga apfo pfipfo pfaili.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli keyamila hambele he Felikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Imkulu we ghumkoa kamgholosela chidole Pauli ili alonge, Pauli kalonga, “Kwaapfila nomanya ghweghwe kwa imlamutsi we isi ino kwa imiyaka pilikichi, lelo neyamila kwa kudeng'elela. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Kodaha kumanya imwenyegho, ng'aghabitile bae ghamatsuwa kumi na meli kulawa hanighendile Yerusalemu kutamanila. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Iwanu wano ng'awambonile mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu nesonga ne imunu wowose, wala ukutenda hengele mne tsing'anda tse kulombela au hanu hohose mne ghumji. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Nawo ng'awodaha bae kukulangusa maghomba ghawo kuna nene ka gholongesa. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Bali nene notoghola ka nomtamanila Imulungu wa aba tsetu kwa nzila ila yawoikema wawo nzila ye ughutsu. Notoghola ghose ighandikighwe mne ipfitabu pfe ghamalaghitso na pfe manabii we Imulungu, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />na nene nomlolela Imulungu ka wawo pfawomlolela, ka kuna ukutsilihuka kwe iwanu iwafile, wose iwanoghile ne iwehile. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Apfo ghamatsuwa ghose nekatsa niwe na ghumoyo ghunoghile kwe Imulungu na kwe iwanu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Tsanikala kutali kwa imiyaka mingi, lelo mbuya Yerusalemu kuwaghalila nzawadi iwahingwa we isi yangu na kulapfa nambiko. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Tsawambona mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu haning'ali notenda pfinu apfo, tsawanipfika nimalitsa ukudeghetetsighwa. Tsakukala haduhu iwanu wengi hamwe na nene, kuya tsahaduhu hengele lyolyose. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Lekeni tsakukala na Wayahudi wangi iwalawile isi ya Asiya, hawo tsawabamighwa wawe hano hambele hako kughala lighomba ka wana imbuli yoyose kuna nene. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Au iwanu wano iwenyegho walonge totso lyachi lyawonile kuna nene hanyimile hambele ha libalatsa, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ila tsanonga chinu chino kwa kukemelela hambele hawo, ‘Nohighighwa kwaapfila notoghola iwanu watsotsilihuka.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Kuya Felikisi, iyamanyile ghoya mbuli tse Inzila ila, kemitsa lighomba alyo, kawalongela, “Nitsolamla lighomba lyenu hayatsokutsa Lisiya, imkulu we asikali.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Kuya kamlaghitsa imkulu we asikali yamlolese Pauli, lekeni yamlekele chidogho, na yawaleke sale tsake wamwapfile.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Haghabitile ghamatsuwa mengi Felikisi katsa na mwehe wake Dulisila, iyakalile Myahudi. Kalaghitsa Pauli yakemighwe na kamtegheletsa hayang'ali yolonga mbuli tse ukumtoghola Yesu Kiristu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Lekeni Pauli hayang'ali yoghendelela ukulonga mbuli iimtenda imunu yanoghe hambele he Imulungu, na mbuli tsa kuwa na kiyasi, na mbuli tse litsuwa lya ukuhighighwa ilikutsa, Felikisi ang'ali yopfuka, kalonga, “Uleke tanu, sambi kodaha kughenda, hanitsopata nyafasi nitsokukema.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Kuya Feliksi tsayang'ali yololela ka Pauli ang'amwing'ile sendi, apfo chila mala tsakamkema na kulonga naye. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Imiyaka mili haimalile, Polikiyo Festo tsakambokela Felikisi kutawala, kawa imkulu we isi. Lekeni kwaapfila Felikisi tsakabama awadeng'elese Wayahudi, kamleka Pauli mwigheletsa.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Pauli kobama yakahighighwe na Mkulu wa Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ghamatsuwa madatu kulawa hapfikile Kaisariya, Festo kagheluka Yerusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />ako iwatambika wakulu na iwabala wa Wayahudi wamlongela maghomba gha Pauli. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Wamlomba yawanoghese kwa kumghala Pauli Yerusalemu ili wamkome hayang'ali mnzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Festo kawedika, “Pauli kamwigheletsa ako Kaisariya, na nene nobama mbuye ako matsuwa chidogho ighakutsa. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Mleke pfilongotsi wenu wamwenga waghende na nene, waghale maghomba ghake, ka katenda ichinu chochose chihile.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festo hayamalitse kukala nawo ghamatsuwa manane au kumi, kahulumka Kaisariya, litsuwa liwinzile kaghenda kune libalatsa, kalaghitsa Pauli yaghalighwe amo. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Pauli hapfikile awala Wayahudi iwatsile kulawa Yerusalemu wema habehi naye, wamlapfila maghomba makulu, ghang'awadahile kulangusa ka ghana ukweli. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Baho Pauli kabela kalonga, “Nene sitendile chochose chihile mna malaghitso gha Wayahudi, wala mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, wala kwa imndewa wa Roma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Lekeni Festo kabama awadeng'elese Wayahudi, kamlongela Pauli, “Pfii kobama kughenda Yerusalemu ukahighighwe ako hambele hangu kwa maghomba ghano?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pauli kedika, “Nene nakwima hano mne libalatsa lya mndewa wa Roma, nobamighwa nihighighwe hano. ka ghweghwe imwenyegho pfumanya ghoya, sitendile bae ichinu chochose chihile kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Lelo ka kuna ichinu chochose chihile chanendile ichitenda nikomighwe, silema kufa bae. Lekeni maghomba ghawangaile Wayahudi ng'agholongesa bae, haduhu imunu iyodaha kunyika mne ghamoko ghawo. Ngaleni kwa imndewa wa Roma!”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Kuya Festo hamalitse kulonga ne iwanu wake wa libalatsa, kalonga, “Kobama ughende kwa imndewa wa Roma, haya kutsoghenda kwa imndewa wa Roma!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli hambele ha Agiripa na Benike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ghamatsuwa chidogho haghabitile, mndewa Agiripa na Benike wapfika Kaisariya kumlamsa Festo. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Hawakalile ako kwa ghamatsuwa chidogho, Festo kamlongela imndewa mbuli tsa Pauli. Kalonga, “Ahano hana imunu, Felikisi tsakamleka mwigheletsa. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Hang'endile Yerusalemu, iwatambika wakulu na iwabala wa Wayahudi wanongela ghamaghomba ghake, kuya wabama yahighighwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Na nene niwalongela si pfipfo bae pfawotendagha Waroma, kumkoma imunu wowose ng'ana yetingane ne iwanu iwamwing'ile ghamaghomba na kumleka yeyamile. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Hawatsile hano, na nene sikawile bae, litsuwa liwinzile tsanikala mne libalatsa, nilaghitsa imunu yuno yaghalighwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Iwanu wala iwaghalile lighomba, hawemile ng'awalongile ichinu chihile kuna yeye ka pfandolele. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Bali tsawang'ali wesonga naye mna mbuli tsawo tsa kutamanila na mbuli tse imunu yumwe iyafile, iyakemighwe Yesu, lekeni Pauli ang'ali yolonga imunu ayo ka mghima. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Kwaapfila tsasimanyile bae nendetse kwa ghamaghomba ghano, apfo nimghutsa Pauli ka tsakabama yaghende Yerusalemu yahighighwe ako. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Lekeni Pauli kabama yahighighwe na Mkulu wa Roma. Apfo nilaghitsa akale hano mbaka hanitsoghenda kwa mndewa wa Roma.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Kuya Agiripa kamlongela Festo, “Na nene nobama nimuhulike imunu yuno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festo kedika, “Kutsomuhulika ilupfi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli hambele ha Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Litsuwa liwinzile Agiripa na Benike watsa aku wapfala maghwanda ghanoghile gha undewa, wengila hane libalatsa kwa ndeng'elelo hamwe na iwakulu we asikali na iwakulu wa kaye. Festo kalaghitsa Pauli yaghalighwe mghati. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festo kalonga, “Imndewa Agiripa ne iwanu wose yamli hano, momwona imunu yuno! Wayahudi wose ako Yerusalemu na hano Kaisariya wanilomba nimlapfe yakomighwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Lekeni nene sonile bae ichinu chochose ichimtenda yakomighwe, naye kwaapfila tsakabama yahighighwe na Mkulu wa Roma, ndamla kumghala Roma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Lekeni nene nahela imbuli ya ukumwandikila Imtawala mkulu. Apfo nimghala hano hambele henu, ghendoghendo hambele hako ghweghwe Imndewa Agiripa, mng'amalitsa kumghutsa nipate ichinu cha ukwandika. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwaapfila nakona ng'apfinoghile bae kumghala mwohighwa bila kulangusa ghomba lyake.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Pauli keyamila hambele ha Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Kuya Agiripa kamlongela Pauli, “Sambi kodaha kwiyamila.” Baho Pauli kenula ghumoko, kandusa kwiyamila. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Mndewa Agiripa, leloli nebona nina ndondokela ukwima hambele hako kwiyamila ghamaghomba ghose gha Wayahudi.” <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Kwaapfila ghweghwe komanya pfihendo pfose pfa Wayahudi na aghala ghose ghawehisanyila. Apfo nolomba ufunye ghumoyo unitegheletse.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Wayahudi wose womanya pfanikalile kulawa udodo wangu, pfanikalile muisi mwangu kulawa mwanduso, na pfipfila ako Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wanimanya kulawa ghumwande, nawo ka wobama wodaha kukulongela ka tsanikala mne kingili lya Mafarisayo iwamtamanila ng'ani Imulungu kubita wanu wangi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Lelo nyima hano nyihighighwe kwaapfila notoghola laghano lyekile Imulungu ne iwabala wetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Ghamakabila ghetu kumi na meli ghobetetsa laghano alyo litimile, ka pfaghomtumikila ghoya Imulungu ichilo ne imisi. Lelo kwaajili ayo, ghwe Mndewa, Wayahudi wanighala mwigheletsa. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Ebali mwakona ng'aidahika bae Imulungu kuwatsilihula iwanu iwafile? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Nene imwenyegho tsambona nobamighwa nende ghose ighodahika ili kupinga taghwa lya Yesu wa Natsareti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Tsanenda apfo ako Yerusalemu, kwa ghamalaghitso ghe iwatambika wakulu tsaniwaghela mwigheletsa wahenzeluka wengi, na hawang'ali wokomighwa na nene tsaning'ali notoghola wakomighwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Ghamatsuwa mengi tsaning'ali nighendagha mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela na kuwatowa, kuya tsaniwananaitsa waleke kumtoghola Imulungu. Tsaning'ali niwehila ghendo, mbaka tsang'enda imiji ya kutali kuwadununza.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Litsuwa limwe tsaning'ali nighenda Damasko aku ning'ighwa uwetso na malaghitso ghe iwatambika wakulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mndewa wangu, nemisi haning'ali mnzila, mbona lumwesa kulawa kulanga lwong'ala kubita litsua, lunimwemwesela nene na wayangu chila ubali. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Wose tsatughwa hasi, nene nihulika litsi lyonongela kwa Chihebraniya, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Ebali konidununza? Kwelagha hela ka ng'ombe yoitowa teke ng'weku ye imtwatsa wake.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Kuya nimghutsa, ‘Mtwatsa, ghweghwe nani?’ Mtwatsa kanyidika, ‘Nene na Yesu yumdununza. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Sambi winuke wime. Nikulawila kwaapfila nikusaghula uwe imtumighwa na imkalangama wa agha ghaughonile, na ghanitsokulangusa. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Nitsokukombola mne iwanu wako na iwanu iwali si Wayahudi ako kwanikutuma, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />uwafumbule nenge tsawo na kuwalapfa mchisi wengile hatselu, walawe mne ingupfu ya Setani, wamghalukile Imulungu, kwa kunitoghola nene, waleghusighwe nzambi na wahale hamwe na wose iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kolonga imbuli ye isang'ano yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Apfo Mndewa Agiripa, sighalemile bae maono agho gha kulanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ila nyandusa kwa iwanu wa Damasko, kuya kwa awala iwali Yerusalemu na Yudeya yose, na kwa iwanu si Wayahudi bae. Niwapetela watsileke nzambi tsawo wamuyile Imulungu na walanguse kwa ghamatendo ghawo ka watsileka nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwaapfila nenda apfi, Wayahudi wanighogha mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, na tsawabama wang'ome. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Lekeni Imulungu kanyapfila, mbaka leloli nene nakwima hano kulapfa ukalangama kwe iwadodo ne iwabala. Silonga ichinu chingi bae, ila nowalongela aghala ghawalongile manabii we Imulungu na Musa ka ghang'alawile. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Ka Kiristu Mkombotsi tsakabamighwa yadununzike na ang'awile wa mwanduso kutsilihuka, apfo ang'adahile kughala ghumwanga kwa Wayahudi na kwa Iwanu si Wayahudi bae.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Pauli hang'ali keyamila apfo, Festo kakemelela, “Pauli! Kuna lukwale! Kusoma ng'ani kwausomile kukughela lukwale.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Pauli kedika, “Mkulu Festo, nene si mkalukwale bae, nolonga mbuli itsilongesa na tsa ihekima. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Mndewa Agiripa komanya ipfinu pfino pfose, na nene nodaha kulonga nae bila kupfuka kwaapfila nomanya kuduhu ichinu ichitendeke chinyelenyele. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mndewa Agiripa, apfi kowatoghola manabii we Imulungu? Nomanya kowatoghola.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Kuya Agiripa kamghutsa Pauli, “Apfi kopfikitsa kodaha kunenda niwe mkiristu kwa ichipindi chino chidodo?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pauli kamwidika, “Nomlomba Imulungu mne ichipindi chidodo au chikulu, si ghweghwe uliyeka bae, ila wose yamnitegheletsa leloli, mdahe kuwa ka pfanili nene, lekeni bila iminyororo ino.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Kuya imndewa, imkulu we ghumkowa na Benike, hamwe na awala iwakalile nawo wose tsawenuka. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Na hawang'ali wakuka welongela, “Imunu yuno ng'atendile ichinu ichimtenda yakomighwe wala ukwikighwa mwigheletsa.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agiripa kamlongela Festo, “Imunu yuno ang'alekelelighwe ka ng'abamile bae kuhighighwa na imndewa wa Roma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Pauli koghalighwa Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Hailamlighwe tughende Italiya, Pauli na iwohighwa wangi wekighwa mne ghamoko gha imkulu yumwe wa asikali iyakemighwe Juliasi, wa chikosi ichikemighwe cha Agusti. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tudina mne imeli iilawile Adiramito iibamile kuka kubitila mne mwani tsa isi ye Asiya, kuya tuka. Aristariko imunu wa Makedoniya iyolawila Tesalonike tsakakala mmeli na twetwe.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Litsuwa liwinzile tupfika ako Sidoni, Juliasi tsaang'ali yomtendela pfinoghile Pauli, tsakamleka aghende kuna sale tsake ili wamwing'e aghala ghayobama. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kulawa ako tughendelela na ghumwanza, tubita habehi ne ichisiwa cha Kupulo kwaapfila libeho tsaling'ali likupa ng'ani. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Tsatuloka ibahali ya Kilikiya na Pamfiliya, tupfika Mira ako Likiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ako imkulu yula wa asikali kaipfika imeli ya Alekisandiliya iighenda Italiya, apfo katulongela tudine amwo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tughendelela na ghumwanza lughalugha kwa ghamatsuwa mengi, kwa ukughaya tsatupfika habehi na Nido. Kwaapfila libeho tsaling'ali lyotughoma, tubita lubali lwe kuisi lwe Kirete habehi na Salimone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Kuya tubita kumwani kwa kughaya, kuya tupfika hanu hakemighwe Bandari Inoghile, habehi na kaye ya Leseya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Ghamatsuwa mengi tsaghabita, na litsuwa lya ukufunga ukuja tsalibita. Ghumwanza tsaghukala ghwa mne ihatari ng'ani. Apfo Pauli kawakanya, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Walume weyangu, nakona ghumwanza ghwetu ghutsakuwa na maghayo tutsakwaghitsa imitsigho, imeli na ughima wetu pfipfila.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Lekeni imkulu wa asikali kaleka kuhulikitsa ghayalongile Pauli, kawahulikitsa imkulu we imeli na imunu yane imeli ayo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwaapfila bandari ila ng'ainoghile bae kukala mne ghamatsuwa gha chipfeghetsi, iwanu wangi walamla tulawe ako tughende Foinike ka ing'adahike, na kukala ako ghamatsuwa ghose gha ichipfeghetsi. Foinike tsaikala ibandari ya Kirete iilolese lubali lwa kuchanya na lubali lwa kuisi kwa liswela litsuwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Na libeho lya lubali lwa kuhisi halyanduse kuduma chidoghochidogho, tsawapfikitsa wapata chawabamile, apfo wandusa ghumwanza na kubita kumwani kwa kumwani habehi na Kirete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Hambele chidogho, libeho kali ng'ani liduma kulawa kuchanya kughenda kwalilawila litsuwa. Tsaliduma kulawa mne ichisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Imeli tsaing'ali itowighwa na libeho na ng'ahidaile bae kuliking'a libeho. Apfo tuileka imeli isolighwe na libeho. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Hatung'ali twobita habehi ne ichisiwa chidogho ichikemighwe Kauda, tsatudaha ukwika ghoya ghumnumbwi ghwe imeli, lekeni kwa kughaya. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Iwanu tsawaghukwegha ghumnumbwi mghati, wayowa imeli kwa imitsabi. Tsawapfuka ka wang'adahile ukukwama mne lundo lya msanga lya Libiya, apfo wahulumsa matanga na kuileka isolighwe na libeho. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Kwaapfila wang'ali wotowighwa ng'ani ne nyahemu, litsuwa lya keli wandusa ukwasa imitsigho mne ibahali. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Litsuwa lya kadatu, wasa ipfinu pfe imeli mne ibahali kwa ghamoko ghawo iwenyegho. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa ghamatsuwa mengi ng'atudahile bae ukwona lilangi wala tsinondo, na nyahemu ng'ulu tsaing'ali ighendelela. Tsakukala kuduhu imunu iyalolele kuhona.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Hawakalile ghamtsuwa mengi bila ukuja, Pauli kema mghati mwawo, kalonga, “Tsambamighwa mnihulikitse nene na mng'alekile kulawa Kirete, namwe mng'alekile kwingila mne ghamaghayo ghano na ukwaghisa pfinu. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Lelo nowalomba muwe na ghumoyo, kwaapfila kuduhu imunu kuna mwemwe iyatsokwagha, ila imeli iliyeka itsohinyika. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Ichilo chibitile malaika we Imulungu yula nene yanili munu wake, na yanimtumikila, kema habehi yangu, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />kanongela, ‘Pauli uleke kupfuka, kobamighwa wime hambele ha mndewa wa Roma. Kwaajili yako Imulungu katsokombola ughima wa chila imunu mne imeli.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Apfo msangalale! Kwaapfila nomtoghola Imulungu itsolawila ka pfanongele. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Lekeni tutsoghalighwa mbaka mne chisiwa chingi.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Mne chilo cha litsuwa lya kumi na nne, tsatung'ali tusolighwa akuno na akuno mne ibahali ya Mediteraniya. Nechilo ng'ani iwanu we imeli tsawapfikitsa twa habehi ne isi. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Apfo wabama wamanye utali we ichilindi che ibahali kwa kuhulumsa lutsabi lwohighwe chinu chitito, wapata utali wa mita alubaini, hambele chidogho watenda apfo keli, wapata utali wa mita selasini. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Kwaapfila wapfuka kukwama mne ghamabambalawe, wahulumsa nanga nne kuchughu mwe imeli, walomba uche. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Iwanu iwolongotsa imeli tsawabama watsume waileke imeli. Apfo wahulumsa ghumnumbwi ghula mdodo mne ghamatsi, watenda ka woghenda kuhulumsa nanga kulawa hambele he imeli. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Lekeni Pauli kamlongela imkulu yula wa asikali na asikali wake, “Awano ka ng'awatsokala mne imeli, ng'amdaha bae kukomboka.”<verse eid="ACT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Apfo asikali waighana imitsabi ikindile ghumnumbwi ghula mdodo, waghuleka usolighwe ne ghamatsi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Na hakung'ali kwakucha Pauli kawalomba wose waje ichijo, kalonga, “Kwa ghamatsuwa kumi na mane, tsamng'ali mwoghanzika, ng'amjile ichinu chochose bae. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Lelo nowalomba msole ichijo mje, kwaapfila ichijo chobamighwa kwaajili ya ughima wenu. Kuduhu hata imvili imwe iitsokwagha mne ghamatwi ghenu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Hayamalitse kulonga apfi, kasola chighate, kalonga mighede kwe Imulungu hambele hawo wose. Kuya kachibena, kandusa kuchija. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Wose waghumighwa ghumoyo, na chila imunu kaja ichijo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Iwanu wose yatukalile mne imeli tsatukala iwanu miya mbili, sabini na sita. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Haweghutile, wahungutsa utito we imeli kwa ukwasa ingano mne ibahali.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imeli yohinyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Hakuchele, ng'awaimanyile bae isi ila, lekeni wona msanga kumwani, apfo walamla kuighala imeli ako ka wang'adahile. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Waghana mitsabi ye tsinanga, watsileka mne ibahali, waidohola imitsabi iikindile msukani, kuya wenula litanga lya hambele he imeli ili likinde libeho na kutughala kumwani. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Lekeni imeli tsaipfika hanu hane nzila mbili tsa ghamatsi ghe ibahali, na imeli ikwama. Hambele he imeli hakala hatsama mne ghumsanga na ng'aidahile kuseghela bae, na kuchughu kwandusa ukubeneka kwaajili ye ingupfu ya ghamawimbi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Asikali tsawabama wawakome wohighwa, hela waleke koghelela na kutsuma. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Lekeni imkulu wa asikali tsakabama Pauli yakomboke, apfo kawaghoma asikali wake waleke ukutenda apfo. Kawalaghitsa awala iwodaha ukoghelela wadaluke kulawa mne imeli, woghelele mbaka kumwani. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Na iwanu wangi iwasighale, waghoghe tsimbao au mne ipfihindi pfe imeli. Apfo iwanu wose wapfika tseghamba kumwani.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Mne ichisiwa cha Melita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Hatupfikile tseghamba kumwani, tsatumanya ichisiwa chila chokemighwa Melita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wenye kaye watutendela uluso ghendo, watubwinila ghumoto twote kwaapfila imvula tsaing'ali itowa na tsakukala ne ichipfeghetsi. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pauli tsakadondola tsingodi, na hayang'ali yotsika mmoto, ghumoto ghula ghumtenda nzoka yalawe mne tsingodi na kumluma Pauli na kwikindilitsa mna ghumoko ghwake. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wenye kaye hawamwonile inzoka ayo kolebela mmoko mwake, welongela, “Imunu yuno kakoma imunu ghendo, hata ka kahona mne ibahali, chisasi che milungu ng'achimlekelela bae yakale mghima.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Lekeni Pauli kamkung'usila inzoka ayo mmoto na kuduhu chihile ichimpatile. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Tsawapfikitsa katsopfimba au bahala katsakughwa hasi na ukufa, lekeni hawabetile kwa ichipindi chitali, na ng'awonile bae ichinu chihile ichimlawile, waghalusa mawatso ghawo, walonga Pauli tsakakala yumwe we milungu.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Habehi na hanu hala tsakukala na imighunda ye imkulu we chisiwa iyakemighwe Pabiliyo. Imunu ayu tsakatubokela ghoya na tukala iwahenza wake kwa ghamatsuwa madatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Aba wake tsakakala kawasa mlutsatsi, koghula lihoma na kupweleta idamu. Pauli kaghenda ukumlola na hayamalitse kulomba, kamwikila ghamoko, kamuhonetsa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Haghalawile agho, iwanu wengi iwang'ali woghula mne ichisiwa chila, nawo watsa wahonetsighwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Watwing'a nzawadi ketseketse, na hatung'ali tweyandaa ukuka, tsaweka mne imeli chila ichinu chatubamile mne ghumwanza.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulawa Melita kughenda Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Imiyetsi midatu haimalile tughendelela na ghumwanza kwa imeli imwe ya Alekisandiliya iikemighwe “Milungu Basa,” imeli ayo tsaikala hala Melita ghamatsuwa ghe ichipfeghetsi. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tupfika Sirakusa na ukukala aho ghamatsuwa madatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kulawa ako tughenda ghumji ghwa Regiyo. Litsuwa liwinzile libeho lyandusa kuduma kulawa lubali lwa kuhisi, na litsuwa lya kabili tupfika Potioli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ako tuwapfika iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu, watulomba tukale nawo ghamatsuwa saba. Kuya tupfika Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Iwanu iwamtoghole Yesu ako Roma tsawahulika ka tsatung'ali tukutsa, apfo watsa kutubokela mne ghulilo lya Apiyo na ng'anda ndatu tsa kuwasila wagheni. Pauli hawonile kamtunya Imulungu, tsakaghumighwa ghumoyo ng'ani.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli mne ghumji ghwa Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Hatupfikile Roma, Pauli tsakalekelighwa kukala yaliyeka hamwe ne asikali iyang'ali yombetetsa.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ghamatsuwa madatu hambele kawakema hamwe pfilongotsi wa Wayahudi. Hawetingane Pauli kawalongela, “Ndughu tsangu, nene sitendile chinu chochose bae chihile kwe iwanu wangu, wala silemile ipfihendo pfe iwabala wetu. Lekeni tsanighoghighwa ako Yerusalemu na kwikighwa mne ghamoko ghe Waroma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Waroma hawamalitse kunighutsa wabama wandekelele, kwaapfila nahela totso ilinitenda nikomighwe <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Lekeni pfilongotsi wa Wayahudi hawalemile, chinu acho chinitenda nibame nihighighwe ne mndewa wa Roma. Lekeni nene nahela ghomba lyolyose ne iwanu wangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Kwaajili ayo niwakema niwone na nonge namwe, kwaapfila nyohighwa minyororo ino kwaajili ya mkombotsi iwomlolela iwanu wa Isiraeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Nawo wamlongela, “Twetwe ng'ana tubokele bae ibaluwa yoyose ilawile Yudeya, kuya kuduhu iwanu iwatsile kulawa ako kutulongela mbuli tsako tsihile. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Lekeni twobama tukuhulike ghweghwe ghumwenyegho ulongatse, kwaapfila chatumanya twetwe chila hanu iwanu wolilonga pfihile kingili lyako lino.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Apfo welaghana wetingane na Pauli mne litsuwa lingi, na iwanu wengi wamtsila ukaye yake. Kulawa nemitondo mbaka nemihe Pauli tsakawalongela mbuli tse undewa we Imulungu, na kwa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa na ghamaandiko ghe wanabii we Imulungu, kaghetsa kuwakwegha wamtoghole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Iwanu wamwenga waghatoghola ghayalongighwe na Pauli, lekeni wamwenga ng'awatoghole bae. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Hawang'ali wesonga wawo kwa wawo na kwandusa ukuka, Pauli kalonga imbuli ino, “Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka tsakalonga ghoya kuna iwabala wenu kubitila Isaya, nabii we Imulungu. <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />tsakalonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Ghenda uwalongele iwanu wano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">mtsohulika na kuhulika lekeni ng'amtsomanya bae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">mtsolola na kulola lekeni ng'amtsakona bae,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />kwaapfila imimoyo ye iwanu wano mikomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">maghutwi ghawo waghadiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">tsinenge tsawo watsifing'ilisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Waleke ukwona kwa tsinenge tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na kuhulika kwa maghutwi ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na kumanya kwa imimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">watsileke nzila tsawo tsihile, kuya niwahonetse.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Kuya Pauli kalonga, “Apfo nobama mmanye imbuli ye ukombotsi wa Imulungu ighalighwa kuna Iwanu si Wayahudi, wawo watsoihulikitsa!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Pauli hamalitse kulonga apfo, Wayahudi woka aku wesonga ng'ani iwenyegho kwa iwenyegho.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa miyaka mili Pauli tsakakala baho mne ing'anda iyoilihila kodi, na kawabokela iwanu wose iwabamile kumwona. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Kawapetela iwanu mbuli tse Undewa we Imulungu, kuya kalangulitsa mbuli tse Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu bila kupfuka, na kuduhu imunu yamghomile.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>